<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">SANG'HANO - Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Sang'hano</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na Sang'hano za Wasenga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sang'hano za Wasenga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sang'hano</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sang'hano</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano za Wasenga ni lusimo lwa chanduso cha Bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito na vija usenga vuupwililisigwe kulawa Yelusalemu mbaka Uyahudi, na Samalia na mgwazo mgwazo mwa isi, kama vija Yesu viyawalongele waluko wake yahawa yang'hali hanasoligwa kuchanha kuulanga 1:8. Yandikigwa na Luka yandike Usenga Unogile wa Luka. Luka kakala Dakitali na kakala yokwika goya hisabu. Luka kabanda vose vidi Usenga Unogile wa Luka na chitabu cha Sang'hano chiyamwandikile ‘Teofilo' ija yakalile Muyunani, mbali vitabu viwagesa waja wamtogole Kilisito Wayunani na Wayahudi 1:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano za Wasenga chandikigwa hagati ya milao 60-64 kulawa viyavumbuke Kilisito kwavija chitabu chimala Paulo kakala yang'hali hanalekeseligwa kulawa mdigeleza. Luka ivija kakala yogenda na Msenga Paulo ivija yodahika kandika chitabu cha Sang'hano za Wasenga muikae ya Antiokia. Sang'hano ni mgendelelo wa usenga wa Luka na mwanduso wa mgendo wa Yesu kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Chiyalondile kwandika Luka ni sawa na ichija chili muusenga wake. Luka kamlonda Teofilo, ivija kalonda kongeza hisabu ya wamtogole Kilisito kua wanhu wa chija chiyafundile na ivo kandika vinogile hisabu ya ugima wa Yesu na kupwililisa Ukilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano choching'ha cheye mfano wa bumbila da mwanduso da wamtogole Kilisito na vija viioneka kama kukala bila kumtogola Kilisito. Mfano wa Wasenga wachilagusa cheye vichilondeka kugewela muudaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu kwa kupwililisa mbuli ya usenga kwa wanhu wamwenga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo mchitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Mosi Muhe wa Mulungu kawezila waluko wa Yesu na Bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito disonga kongezeka Muisula 1:1-8-1.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala Bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito didununzika na disonga kuligula muugwazo mwa Yelusalemu Muisula 8:2-12-23.</para>
  <para style="io">Labaho Paulo kaita mwanza wake wa kuligula Usenga unogile Muisula 12:24-1428.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala chitala chiiting'hanila uko Yelusalemu kulongelela chija chilondeka kwa waja wamtogola Kilisito wa sambi Muisula 15:1-35.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala Paulo kaita mwanza wakaidi ya kuligula Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga Muisula 15:36-1822.</para>
  <para style="io">Viyalawile uko Paulo kaita mwanza wa kadatu ya kuligula Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga Muisula 18:23-20-38.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala Paulo kagogigwa uko Yelusalemu Muisula 21-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Hachikomelezo Paulo kagaligwa uko Lumi Muisula 27-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Gomkulu Teofilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mchitabu changu chilongole, nikwandikila mbuli zose Yesu viyatendile na kufunda kulawa viyasongile sang'hano zake <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka mdizua dija viyasoligwe kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Viyakalile yang'hali hanasoligwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kaweng'ha malagizo kwanzila ya Muhe wa Mulungu waja watumigwa yawasagule. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Mmazua alubaini kulawa ifa yake Yesu kakala yowalawila mala kwa mala kwaivo yolagusa kua kakala mgima. Nayo Yesu kakala yowafunda kwambuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Na viwaiting'hane hamwe nao kawalagiza vino, “Sekemsegele Yelusalemu ila ibeteni ija nhunza iyalalike Tata, ija imunihulike viniilongelela. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana kabatiza kwa mazi, mbali mmazua madodo gokwiza, mweye mobatizigwa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosoligwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Baho, watumigwa wa Mulungu viwaiting'hane na Yesu, wamuuza, “Ivo, Mndewa, uno uwo msimo wa kuwabwelezela Waizilaeli ufaume?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Tataangu yaiyeka iyo yovimanya msimo na chipindi cha mbuli zino zolawila lini, na simbuli yenu kuvimanya yokua lini. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mbali Muhe wa Mulungu vonda yawezile mweye, mobokela udaho na moita kuwalongela wanhu wose mbuli zangu mui Yelusalemu na muiisi yose ya Yudea na Samalia mbaka chila hanhu mziisi zose.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Viamalile kulonga gago, kuno wose womlola, kasoligwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu, amala wingu dimfisa hawamuonile kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Viwakalile wang'hali wolola uchanha kuulanga, viyakalile yogenda, bahaja walume waidi wakalile wavala vivalo vizelu wema habehi nao <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />na walonga, “Mweye wanhu wa Galilaya! mbona mwima kuno molola kuulanga? Yesu iyo yasoligwe kulawa kumwenu kuita kuulanga, kokwiza kobwela kaidi ivija kama vumumuona viyoita kuulanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matia kosaguligwa yasole nyafasi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Amala watumigwa waja wabwela Yelusalemu kulawa kulugongo lukemigwa lugongo lwa Mizeituni uli utali wa kilomita imwe kulawa kuikae iyo. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Viwavikile kuikae wengila mdigati da golofa muja muwakalile wokala, na wengile umo wakala Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo na Andulea na Filipo na Toma, Batulomayo na Matayo na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo, Simoni mgombela isi yake na Yuda mwanage Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Wano wose wakala woikunzanya hamwe kupula, hamwe na Malia mami yake Yesu na wanachike wamwenga na waja waleligwe hamwe na Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mdizua ijo wanhu wakalile waikunzanye hamwe kupula, wose wakala wanhu mia na ishilini. Petulo kema hagati yao kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Mbwiga zangu Mayandiko galondeka kavikile gaja Muhe wa Mulungu kalonga kubitila Daudi, kwambuli ya Yuda, ija yawalongoze wanhu waja wamgogile Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda kakala imwe mmwetu manake kasaguligwa chisang'hane nayo.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Baho Yuda kagula mgunda kwa zija sente yazipatile kwa ubananzi. Viyakalile uko kumgunda kagwa na kutulika zinda na utumbo ulawa kunze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Chila munhu mui Yelusalemu kahulika mbuli iyo na kwa ulonzi wao waukema mgunda uja,“Akelidama,” manake, “Mgunda wa damu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Baho, kama viyandikigwe mchitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Ng'anda yake isigale mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">munhu yoyose seke yakale umo.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">Kaidi yandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Munhu imwenga yasaguligwe yasole nyafasi yake.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Baho munhu imwe mmwao kolondeka yailumbe na cheye ija chiilumba nayo mala zose Yesu viyakala yogenda na cheye, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kulawa Yohana viyambatize Yesu mbaka zua dija Yesu viyasoligwe kulawa kumwetu kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Iyo kosang'hana sang'hano hamwe na cheye kwambuli ya kuwalongela wanhu wose kwambuli ya uzilibuko wake Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Baho, watambula mazina ga wanhu waidi, imwe Yosefu yakemigwe Balasaba hebu Yusto, na wakaidi Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Labaho wapula walonga, “Mndewa, gweye kuimanya mioyo ya wanhu wose. Ivo uchilagusile, yelihi kati ya wano waidi ija umsagule <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ili yeze yasole nyafasi ino ya sang'hano ya utumigwa yailekile Yuda kagenda hanu hake mwenyego.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Watoa simbi, simbi imgwila Matia, nayo kongezigwa mwa waja watumigwa wamwenga kumi na imwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Muhe wa Mulungu kawahulumukila wamtogole Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Vidivikile zua da Pentekoste, wose wamtogole Yesu wakala waikunzanye hanhu hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Bahaja dizi kama mbumo mkulu wa beho ulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu uimemeza ng'anda yose iwakalile. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Labaho vilawilila vinhu vioneke kama ng'humbi da moto, viigolie na kuwakalila uchanha mwa chila munhu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wose walongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, wasonga kulonga ulonzi umwenga si wao kama Muhe wa Mulungu viyawadahize. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Uko Yelusalemu wakala Wayahudi womfugamila Mulungu, wolawa chila hanhu muiisi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Chila munhu kawahulika bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito. Wose wasinhuka kuwahulika wolonga kwa ulonzi wake mwenyego. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Wazaganyika na kukanganya kuno woiuza, “Ivo, wano wose ichiwahulika sio wenekae wa Galilaya! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Yokuwaze chila munhu mmwetu kowahulika viyolonga chaukae? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamwenga mmwetu wolawila isi ya Pati na wa Medi na wa Elamu na wamwenga wenekae wa Mesopotamia, Uyahudi na Kapadokia na Ponto na Asia. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Wamwenga wolawila Fuligia na Pamfulia na Misili na isi za Libia behi na Kilene, na nyambenyambe kulawa Lumi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Wayahudi na wanhu watogole dini ya Kiyahudi, wamwenga walawa isi ya Kilete isi izungulukigwe na mazi na Alabia. Cheye chose chohulika viwolonga mbuli ng'hulu kwa ulonzi wetu wenyego.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wanhu wose wakanganya na kuzaganyika kuno woiuza, “Mbuli zino manake choni?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Mbali wamwenga wawazeha wolonga, “Wanhu wano wakoligwa divai ya sambi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kowalongela wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Baho Petulo kema haulongozi ha waja watumigwa kumi na imwe kasonga kuwaligulila wanhu kwa dizi kulu, “Wayahudi wayangu na mweye mose wenekae wa hano Yelusalemu, nhegelezeni goya mbuli zangu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Wanhu wano hawakoligwe ka vumgesa, kwavija sambi ni saa nhatu imitondo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Mbali ino ni mbuli iyalongile Yoeli mlagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Mndewa kalonga, ‘Mdizua da uhelelo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nowatilila wanhu wose Muhe wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wanenu wachike na wachilume wokwiza kulava ulagusi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wabwanga wenu woona maloleso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na wavele wenu wolota nzozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Enaa, hata watumigwa wangu wa chike na wachilume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nowatilila Muhe wangu mdizua ijo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nao wazilongelela mbuli zangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nosang'hana uzonza uchanha kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na vilaguso muiisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">hokua na damu na moto na yosi dizamile<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Zua dogeligwa ziza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na mwezi wokua mdung'hu kama damu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">Zua dija kulu na ukulu wa Mndewa dokua ding'hali hadinavika.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Baho yoyose yonda kupula kwazina da Mndewa koloholigwa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Wanhu wa Izilaeli tegelezeni mbuli zino! Yesu wa Nazaleti yakalile na udaho wake uwo uoneka kweli kwanzila ya mujiza na uzonza na vilaguso vija Mulungu yavisang'hane mmwenu kubitila Yesu kama vumanyile. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kulawa haumwanduso Mulungu mwenyego kalonda Yesu yagogigwe na mweye na mweye mumkoma kwa kuwaleka wanhu wehile wamuwambe mumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Labaho Mulungu kamzilibula na kamsegezela usungu wa ifa kwavija havidahike ifa imuhume. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwavija Daudi kalonga kwambuli ya Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Nimuona Mndewa Mulungu mala zose, nayo kabehi na nie kwa kunhaza, ivo sidumba chinhu.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kwaivo, moyo wangu udeng'helela na nhoa ng'henze kwa ndeng'helelo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">na ivija lukuli lwangu nao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">wokwiza kuilegeha mditamanilo,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwavija gweye Mulungu huuleka muhe wangu kwa wanhu wafile, hebu humleka mtumigwa wako mtogoligwa yaole kudipanga.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kunilagusila nzila ya kunilongoza muugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">kokwiza nimemeza ndeng'helo kwavija kwa habehi na niye'<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Mbwiga zangu, nolonda kuwalongeleni hazelu kabisa mbuli zija zimpatile Daudi, wasao wetu. Yeye kadanganika na kawandigwa na panga jake da bahano mbaka vino sambi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ila kwavija Daudi kakala mlagusi, na kavimanya kua Mulungu kamlalika kwa kuilahila kua yahamwikile imwe mwa ulelo wake yawe mfaume kama viyawile yeye. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi kaiona umwaka mbuli ino ing'hali hainalawilila, ivo kalonga kwa mbuli ya uzilibuko wa Kilisito haja viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">halekigwe kudipanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">hebu lukuli lwake hauonile kwa wanhu wafile.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Mulungu iyo yamzilibule ino Yesu na cheye chose chiiona mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu kenuligwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu, yadahe kulongoza hamwe na Mulungu na keng'higwa Muhe wa Mulungu kama Tata viyamlalike. Ivija Yesu kaching'ha Muhe wa Mulungu na chino icho mchihulika na kuchiona. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Daudi mwenyego hasoligwe kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">mbali kalonga Mndewa Mulungu kamlongela Mndewa wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">kala ubanzi wangu wa kulume,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka hondanitende uwalongoze wahasanyi wako.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Waizilaeli wose wavimanye kua ino iyo kweli Yesu imumuwambile mumsalaba iyo ija Mulungu yamtendile kua Mndewa na Kilisito!” <verse eid="ACT 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Baho, wanhu viwahulike ivo, walumila mmoyo wamuuza Petulo na waja watumigwa wamwenga, “Ndugu zetu sambi chitendeze?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petulo kawedika, “Galongeni na kugaleka malozo genu na chila munhu yabatizigwe kwa zina da Yesu Kilisito, na Mulungu kowalekesela malozo genu na kubokela ija nhunza ya Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwavija, laliko dino ni kwambuli yenu na wanenu na wose wokala kutali na waja wose wonda wakemigwe na Mndewa Mulungu wetu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa mbuli zimwenga nyingi Petulo kagangamiza na kuwashwangiza wanhu kuno kolonga, “Iloholeni kulawa muulelo uno wa ubananzi!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wengi wazitogola mbuli zake na kubatizigwa, zua ijo wanhu kama elufu nhatu wongezeka mwa waja wamtogole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wano wose wagendelela kufundigwa na watumigwa wa Yesu na wakala hamwe kama ndugu na waja hamwe na kumpula Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viwokala waja wamtogole Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Watumigwa wa Mulungu wakala wosang'hana vilaguso na miujiza mingi na wanhu wose wakala wokanganya ng'hani na kumwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Waja wose wamtogole Kilisito wagendelela kuwa chinhu chimwe na wakala woigolela vinhu vao. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Wokala wovigula vinhu vao na chila chinhu chiweli nacho, amala waigolela sente chila munhu vija viyalondile. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Wagendelela kuiting'hana hamwe mazua gose hai ng'anda ya Mulungu na chipindi cha ndia waiting'hana mzing'anda zao, kuno woja ndia kwa ndeng'helelo kwa moyo mzelu, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Wamwing'ha Mulungu nhogolwa na wawatogola, chila zua Mndewa kakala yowongezela wanhu wakalile woloholigwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petulo komhonya mbetembete kwa zina da Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Zua dimwe saa tisa chigulogulo Petulo na Yohana wakala woita Haing'anda ya Mulungu kupula. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Chipindi icho, wanhu wakala wompapa munhu imwe mbetembete kulawa viyavumbuke. Chila zua wakala womwika munhu iyo hadilango da ng'anda ya Mulungu wokemigwa, “Lwivi unogile,” ili yapule chinhu chochose kwa wanhu wakalile wokwingila Muing'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Munhu iyo viyawaonile Petulo na Yohana wokwingila Haing'anda ya Mulungu kawapula wamwing'he sente. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petulo na Yohana wambunhulila meso amala Petulo kamlongela, “Chilole cheye!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nayo kawalola kuno kololela kubokela chinhu kulawa kumwao. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Labaho Petulo kamlongela, “Nabule sente mbali chinilinacho icho chinikwing'ha. Kwa udaho wa Yesu Kilisito wa Nazaleti, ima ugende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Labaho, Petulo kamwamha mkono wa kulume, na kamwinula bahaja vifundo na mavindi gake gagangamala. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kazumhazumha na kasonga kugenda. Amala kengila Haing'anda ya Mulungu hamwe na Petulo na Yohana kuno yogenda na kuzumhazumha na kumtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wanhu wose viwamuonile yogenda na kumtogola Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />wammanya kua ija iyo yokalaga haulwivi unogile lwa ng'anda ya Mulungu yopula kutazigwa. Wakanganya ng'hani mbaka hawadahile kuvimanya gaja gamlawilile.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo koligula Haing'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Munhu iyo viyakalile yoilongoza hamwe na Petulo na Yohana wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani na wakimbilila haja hanhu hakuiting'hanila hokemigwa, Luhelengo lwa Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Baho, Petulo viyawaonile wanhu waja kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, habali mokanganya kwa mbuli ino? Mbona mochibunhulina meso kama cheye iyo chimtendile munhu ino yadahe kugenda, kwa udahi wetu wenyego hebu kwa vija cheye chitogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mulungu wa wasaho zetu Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, kamwinula Yesu mtumigwa wake. Iyo iyo mumlavile yalamuligwe ifa na kumlema haulongozi ha Pilato hata kama Pilato kalonda kumlekesa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Yesu kakala munhu wa Mulungu ila mweye mumlema, na mumlonda munhu imwenga yakalile yokoma wanhu yalekesigwe.<verse eid="ACT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Baho, mumkoma yeli chanduso cha ugima, mbali Mulungu kamzilibula na cheye chiiona mbuli iyo na kuilongelela. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Munhu ino yummuona na kummanya kapata ugangamalo kwa kuditogola zina da Yesu, kwa kumtogola Yesu uko kumhonyile kabisa munhu ino kama wose vimmuona. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Sambi ndugu zangu nivimanya kua mweye na wakulu zenu msang'hana gago kwa vija mkala hammanyile. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mbali ivo Mulungu viyakomeleze gaja gayalongile umwaka kubitila walagusi wake wose, kua yolondeka Kilisito yadununzike. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Baho, galongeni na kugaleka malozo genu, mumbwelele Mulungu ili iyo yawalekesele malozo genu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Sang'haneni ivo ili Mndewa yaweng'he nyafasi ya kuilegeha mmoyo na kuwagalila ija Kilisito ija yamalile kuwasagulila iyo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Kolondeka iyo yasigale kuulanga kwa Mulungu mbaka vichivikile chipindi cha kusang'hanika kaidi kwa chila chinhu kama Mulungu viyalongile kubitila walagusi wake wanang'hana. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa ivija kalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu wenu kowagalileni mlagusi kama niye kulawa mmwenu wenyego. Molondeka kumtegeleza kwa chila chinhu chonda yawalongele. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Yoyose ija yoleka kumtegeleza mlagusi iyo, Mulungu kombagula kulawa kwa wanhu wake na kumkoma.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Walagusi wose wa Mulungu, kusongela Samweli na waja wezile hamwande yake, wose walonga kwa mbuli ya gaja gosang'hanika mazua gano. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Malaliko gaja Mulungu gayalavile kubitila walagusi wa Mulungu ni kwa mbuli yenu, na moilumba kusang'hana lagano da Mulungu diyasang'hane na wasaho zenu kama viyamlongele Ibulahimu kubitila ulelo wako, ‘Wanhu wose muiisi wokwing'higwa ganogile ga Mulungu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Baho, Mulungu kamzilibula mtumigwa wake tanhu kamlagiza kumwenu ili yaweng'he ganogile ga Mulungu na kumtenda chila munhu mmwenu yaleke kusang'hana gehile.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petulo na Yohana wogaligwa mchitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petelo na Yohana wakala wang'hali wolonga na wanhu, Walava nhambiko wamwenga na mkulu wa wamilizi wa ng'anda ya Mulungu hamwe na Masadukayo waiting'hanila. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wehiligwa ng'hani kwavija wao wasenga wa Mulungu wakala wawaligulila wanhu kua Yesu kazilibuka, chinhu chigangamiza kua wanhu wafile wozilibuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Baho wamgoga Petulo na Yohana na kuweka mdigeleza mbaka igolo yake, kwavija ikala chigulogulo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Mbali wengi wahulike usenga uja waulongile Petulo na Yohana wautogola, na wanhu wautogole usenga uo wakala walume behi na elufu tano. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Igolo yake, vilongozi wa Wayahudi na wavele vilongozi na wafunda ndagizi waiting'hanila hamwe uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Waiting'hanila hamwe na Anasi mkulu wa Walava nhambiko, Kayafa na Yohana na Alekizanda na wamwenga wakalile wa lukolo lwa mlava nhambiko. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Petulo na Yohana viwemile haulongozi wao, wawauza, “Mweye motenda mbuli zino kwa udaho gani na kwa ukulu wa nani?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Baho, Petelo, yakalile yolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu kawalongela, “Mweye wakulu na wavele wa Izilaeli! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Yahawa mochiuza lelo kwambuli inogile iyatendeligwe ija mbetembete na vija viyapatile kua mgima, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />baho mweye na wanhu wose wa Izilaeli molondeka mvimanye kuwa munhu ino kema haulongozi wenu lelo yeli mgima kabisa, kwa udaho wa zina da Yesu wa Nazaleti ija immmuwambile mumsalaba mbali Mulungu kamzilibula. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu iyo iyo Mayandiko ga Mulungu galonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Dibwe dimlemile mweye wazengaji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">sambi diwa dibwe kulu da usimikilo.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Yesu yaiyeka iyo yodaha kulohola wanhu, kwavija muiisi yose habule zina diching'higwe dilondeka kuloholigwa najo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Wao wakulu wa chitala, viwaonile Petulo na Yohana wolonga bila kugwaya na kuvimanya kua wakala wanhu nzakabwa welibule ilimu, waja wavele wawakanganya ng'hani. Wavimanya kuwa wakala wailumba na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Mbali viwamuone ija munhu yahonyigwe kema hamwe nao, hawalongile chinhu. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ivo wawalongela walawe kunze mchitala, nao wasigala mng'anda wolongelela waiyeka. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Waiuza, “Chiwatendeze wanhu wano? Chila munhu yokala Yelusalemu kavimanya kuwa mujiza uno usang'hanika na cheye hachidaha kuilema mbuli ino. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mbali ili chidahe kuikimila mbuli ino seke yenele ng'hani kwa wanhu, chiwagome wanhu wano sekewalonge na munhu yoyose kwambuli za Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Kwaivo wawakema kaidi mng'anda, wawalakila seke walonge kaidi kwa wanhu hebu kufunda kwazina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Baho Petulo na Yohana wawedika, “Lamuleni mweye wenyego kama vinoga ha Mulungu kuwategeleza mweye hebu kumtegeleza Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Mbali cheye hachidaha kuleka kulonga mbuli zichionile na kuzihulika. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Baho, waja wavele wa chitala wawakomhokela ng'hani kwa ludoko, amala wawalekesa waite. Hawadahile kuwatowa hebu kuwafunga mdigeleza, kwavija wanhu wose wakala womtogola Mulungu kwambuli ino. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Munhu iyo yahonyigwe kakala na milao yobita alubaini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Womtogola Yesu wopula Mulungu yawongezele udahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bahaja Petulo na Yohana viwalekesigwe, wabwela kwa wayao, wawalongela gaja gose gawalongiligwe na wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wakulu wa wavele. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Naviwahulike mbuli izo wailumba hamwe na kumupula Mulungu walonga, “Go Mndewa, iyo ulumbile ulanga na isi na bahali na vinhu vose viliumo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Iyo umtendile mtumigwa wako, tata yetu Daudi, yalonge kwa udaho wa Muhe wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Habali wanhu wa isi zimwenga wagevuzike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Mbona wanhu wasang'hana mbuli za chakachaka?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Wafaume wa isi waitanda goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na wakulu waiting'hana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">kumlema Mndewa na Kilisito wake.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwa vovose, Helode na Pontio Pilato na wanhu wa Izilaeli na wanhu haweli Wayahudi, waiting'hana muikae ino kumlema Yesu mtumigwa wako umtumile ija umsagule. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Waiting'hanila ili wasang'hane gaja ugalondile galawile kwa udaho wako kulawa umwaka yalawile. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Sambi gweye Mndewa lola viwachitenda chidumbe, chokupula uchidahize cheye watumwa wako kuligula usenga wako bila kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Lagusa udaho wako wa kuhonya, uhonye wanhu. Sang'hana vilaguso na uzonza kwa zina da Yesu mtumigwa wako umsagule.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Viwamalile kupula, hanhu haja hawakalile waiting'hane hatigisika, na wose walongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu na wasonga kuligula usenga wa Mulungu bila kudumba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamtogole Yesu wakala kama lukolo lumwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Wanhu wose wamtogole Yesu wakala na moyo umwe na wagesa dimwe habule munhu yoyose yaonile chinhu chake yelinacho chake yaiyeka, ila waigolela vose welinavo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Watumigwa wa Mulungu wagendelela kulonga kwa udaho mkulu na Mulungu kaweng'ha ganogile gake makulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Habule munhu yoyose yahungukiligwe na chinhu, kwavija wanhu wakalile na migunda hebu ng'anda wakala wozigula, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />kaweng'ha watumigwa wa Mulngu sente izo nao wamwing'ha chila munhu kama viyalondile.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kukala na munhu imwe yolawa mulukolo lwa Lawi yavumbuke Kupulo zina jake Yusufu, ija watumigwa wamkema Balaba manake munhu yogela moyo wayage. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Munhu iyo kagula mgunda wake na kasola sente ziyapatile kawenga watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anania na Safila wovwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Hakala na munhu imwe yokemigwa Anania na mwehe wake yokemigwa Safila wagula mgunda wao. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Anania kasola sente chidodo ziyapatile na kuzifisa kuno mwehe wake yoimanya mbuli iyo na sente zisigale kazigala kwa watumigwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Baho Petulo kamuuza,“Anania, habali kumwing'ha nyafasi Mwenembago yaulongoze moyo wako na kukutenda umvwizile Muhe wa Mulungu kwa kufisa sente chidogo zuupatile kwakugula mgunda wako? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Vuukalile ung'hali hunaugula mgunda uo ukala wako, na vuumalile kuugula sente izo ziupatile zikala zako, ivo habali kugesa kutenda mbuli iyo? Humvwizile munhu ila kumvwizila Mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Anania viyahulike ivo, kagwa hasi kadanganika. Wanhu wose viwahulike mbuli izo wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wabwanga wavika, wauzinga lukuli lwake kwa sitili, amala wamulava kunze na wamuwanda. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Amala vigabitile masaa madatu, mwehe wake nayo kengila mbali hachimanyile chija chilawilile. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petulo kamulongela, “Nongele! zino izo sente zose zumpatile vumgulile mgunda wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Nayo mwehe wa Anania kedika,“Enaa iyo izo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petulo kamlongela, “Habali gweye na mulume wako muitogolela kumgeza Muhe wa Mndewa? Tegeleza! Waja wabwanga waitile kumuwanda mulume wako sambi wahaulwivi, nawo wokusola na gweye ivija.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Safila viyahulike ivo kagwa hamagulu ga Petulo na kudanganika, waja wabwanga viwengile wamvika kamala kudanganika, ivo wamlava kunze wamuanda behi na mulume wake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Yesu na wanhu wamwenga viwahulike mbuli iyo wadumba ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa Mulungu wohonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Wasenga wa Mulungu wasang'hana miujiza na miuzonza mingi mwa wanhu. Wamtogole Kilisito wakala woiting'hanila hamwe muluhelengo lwa Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Habule munhu imwenga yoyose yagezile kuilumba nao, mbali wanhu wose wawalongelela goya. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Mndewa, wongezeka ng'hani walume kwa wake. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Hata wanhu wakala wowagala watamu wao muinzila na kuwagoneza mmakomwa na mikeka ili Petulo yahabita sisila jake diwagubike watamu wao na kuwahonya. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Wanhu wengi wavika kulawa mzikae zili behi na Yelusalemu wawagala watamu na wanhu wambule vinyamkela na wose wahonyigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga wa Mulungu wodununzigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Labaho, mkulu wa Walava nhambiko na wayage wakalile bumbila dimwe na Masadukayo wawaonela maya wasenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Baho wawagoga waja wasenga wa Mulungu na kuwagela mdigeleza. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Mbali ichilo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kavugula lwivi lwa geleza kawalava kunze kawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Gendeni mkeme mui ng'anda ya Mulungu mkawalongele wanhu mbuli zose za ugima wa kuilumba na Yesu kulibule uhelelo.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Wasenga wa Mulungu watogola, wengila Haing'anda ya Mulungu imitondo ng'hani, wasonga kufunda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mkulu wa Walava nhambiko na wayage viwavikile, wakema mting'hano wa chitala chikulu na wavele wose wa Izilaeli amala wawalagiza wanhu kudigeleza wawagale waja wasenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mbali waja wamilizi wa ng'anda ya Mulungu viwavikile kudigeleza hawawavikile wasenga wa Mulungu, kwaivo wabwela kugala usenga kwa wavele wa chitala. <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Walonga, “Chivika geleza dihindigwa na wamilizi wema wokwimila lwivi. Mbali vichivugule hachimvikile munhu yoyose mng'anda. <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mkulu wa wamilizi wa ng'anda ya nhambiko na wakulu wa Walava nhambiko viwahulike mbuli iyo wakanganya ng'hani, hawamanyile choni chiwalawilile waja wasenga. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Amala keza munhu imwe kawalongela, “Waja wanhu imuwafungile mdigeleza, vino sambi wa Muing'anda ya Mulungu wofunda wanhu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Kilongozi wa ng'anda ya Mulungu hamwe na wanhu wake waita Kuing'anda ya Mulungu kuwasola wasenga. Mbali hawawagogile kwa kuwaswangiza kwavija wadumba wanhu seke wawatoe mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Wemilizi wao wawagala wasenga wa Mulungu haulongozi wa chitala, mkulu wa Walava nhambiko kawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Chiwakomhokela seke mfunde kwazina da munhu ino mbali mogendelela kupwililisa mafundo genu Yelusalemu yose, monda ioneke kua cheye iyo chanduso cha ifa yake.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Baho Petulo, na waja wasenga wamwenga wedika, “Cholondeka chimtegeleze Mulungu kubita munhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mulungu wa wasaho zetu kamzilibula Yesu, ija mweye imukomile kwa kumuwamba mumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mulungu kamwinula mbaka ubanzi wa kutogoligwa wa Mulungu yawe kilongozi na mlohozi yawatende wanhu wa Izilaeli waleke malozo ili yawalekesele malozo gao. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Cheye chiona mbuli iyo viilawila na Muhe wa Mulungu ija Mulungu yaweng'ile waja wamtegeleze, nayo kogangamiza mbuli iyo.” <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wanhu wose wakalile mkija chitala wagwa ludoko mbaka walonda wawakome waja watumigwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Mbali Falisayo imwe yokemigwa Gamalieli iyo kakala mfundaji wa ndagizi na kutogoligwa na wanhu wose, kema haulongozi wa chitala, kalonda waja watumigwa tanhu walavigwe kunze. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Baho kawalongela waja wakulu wa chitala, mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, “Itiganyeni kwambuli zino, gaja gamlonda kuwatendela wanhu wano. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Milao midodo ibitile, halawila munhu imwe zina jake Teuda kolonga kuwa iyo munhu mkulu na wakala kama mia nne vino wamuwinza. Mbali kakomigwa na waja wose wamuwinzile wapwililika na mbuli yake imalila baho. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Amala kalawilila Yuda munhu wa Galilaya, chipindi cha kupeta wanhu nayo kalongoza bumbila da wanhu walemile ulongozi wa Kilumi, nayo kakomigwa na wajalusona wake wapwililika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Sambi nowalakileni, sekemuwatendele mbuli ihile wanhu wano ila walekeni munhu yahaisonga mbuli ino hebu sang'hano yao hagendelela. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ila yahawa isongigwa na Mulungu, hamdaha kuwakimila wanhu wano. Badili yake mokua kama moihuma na Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Baho waitogolela nayo.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Baho wawakema waja wasenga wabwele mng'anda mchitala, wawalagiza wawalibule miboko, na kuwazuma seke wabwelele kufunda kaidi kwa zina da Yesu, amala wawaleka wasegele. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ivo wasenga waja walawa kunze mchitala weli na ndeng'helelo kwavija Mulungu kaweng'ha nhogolwa kwa kuwaleka wapate chinyala kwambuli ya zina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Chila zua wagendelela kufunda na kuligula Usenga Unogile kua Yesu iyo Kilisito Haing'anda ya Mulungu na mzing'anda za wanuhu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu saba wosaguligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Chipindi icho wajalusona wa Yesu viwakalile wokongezeka kulawila manung'huniko mwa Wayahudi waja wolonga Chiyunani na waja wolonga Chiebulania. Waja wolonga Chiyunani wonung'hunika kua wagane wao wosemwigwa muugolaji wa ndia ya chila zua. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ivo wasenga kumi na waidi wawakunzanya bumbila jose da wajalusona wa Yesu walonga, “Havinogile cheye kuleka kuligula usenga wa Mulungu ili chiwagolele wanhu ndia. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ivo ndugu zetu, saguleni wanhu saba mmwenu weli na nhogolwa inogile wamemile Muhe wa Mulungu na weli na nzewele. Na cheye chowalekela sang'hano iyo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Nacheye chosigala kupula na kuligula usenga wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Mbuli iyo iwanogela wanhu wose mdibumbila da waja wamtogole Mulungu wawasagula Stefano, munhu yomtogola ng'hani Mulungu na yamemile Muhe wa Mulungu, ivija wamsagula Filipo na Pulokolo na Nikanoli na Timoni na Palimena na Nikolao munhu wa Antiokia iyo baho mwaka yakalile kailumba na dini ya Chiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Waweka haulongozi wa wasenga nao wawapulila na kuwapulila ganogile ga Mulungu kwa kuwekila makono.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Wagendelela kuligula usenga wa Mulungu, waluko wengi wagendelela kongezeka ng'hani uko Yelusalemu, na hata Walava nhambiko wengi wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefano kokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Mulungu kamwing'ha Stefano ganogile ga Mulungu na udaho wa kusang'hana uzonza mkulu na miujiza mwa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Mbali Wayahudi wamwenga wa ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi ikemigwa Sinagogi da wanhu hulu, wasonga kuibishila na Stefano. Wanhu wao walawila muikae ya Kulene Alekizandilia na wamwenga walawila Kilikia na Asia. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Mbali Muhe wa Mulungu kamdahiza Stefano kulonga kwa nzewele, hata viwakala wolonga wapotigwa kumuhuma. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ivo wawaswangiza wanhu walonge, “Chimhulika Stefano kolonga mbuli za kumuliga Musa na kumuliga Mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwaivo, wawadinhiza wanhu, wavele na wafundaji ndagizi wagevuzike. Baho wamgoga Stefano na kumgala mchitala. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wagala wanhu wamwenga mchitala ili walonge uvwizi nao walonga, “Munhu ino haleka mbuli za kuliga ng'anda ya Mulungu na ndagizi za Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwavija chimhulika viyolonga kua Yesu wa Nazaleti koibomola ng'anda ino ya Mulungu na kuhindula mazoela gayaching'ile Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wanhu wose wakalile mchitala chija wambunhulila meso Stefano, baho wachiona chihanga chake chikala kama cha mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stefano koigombela mchitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Baho, mkulu wa Walava nhambiko kamuuza Stefano, “Ivo mbuli zino zigoloka?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Nayo Stefano kamwidka, “Ndugu zangu na tata zangu nhegelezeni! Mulungu mkulu kamlawila tati yetu Ibulahimu muiisi ya Mesopotamia kakala yang'hali hanahamila uko Halani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Mulungu kamlongela segela kulawa muiisi yako na kuwaleka walukolo wako, uite mbaka kuiisi yonda nikulagusile.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Kwaivo Ibulahimu kasegela muiisi ya Kalidayo kaita kukala isi ya Halani. Tati yake viyadanganike Mulungu kamlava kaidi Halani keza kukala muiisi ino imkala sambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Mulungu hamwing'ile hata hanhu hadodo ya isi ino ili iwe yake. Mbali kamlalika kumwing'ha isi ino iwe yake na ulelo wake hata kama chipindi icho Ibulahimu hakalile na mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mulungu kamulongela vino, ‘Ulelo wako wogaligwa muuisi ija si yao na uko wotendigwa kua watumwa na kudununzigwa kwa milao mia nne. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Mbali niye noitoa isi iyo mwawadununzigwa. Amala nowalava muisi iyo weze hanhu hano wanifugamile. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Baho Mulungu kamwing'ha Ibulahimu lagano da kwingiza kumbi wana wa chilume. Ivo Ibulahimu kamwingiza kumbi mwanage yokemigwa Isaka zua da nane kulawa viyavumbuke. Na Isaka ivija kamwingiza kumbi Yakobo. Nayo Yakobo ivija kawasang'hanila waja wavele wetu kumi na waidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Kwavija wavele wetu wamonela maya Yusufu wamgula ili yawe mtumwa muiisi ya Misili. Mbali Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kamulohola Yusufu mgamadununzo gake gose kamwing'ha nzewele na kutogoligwa na Falao mfaume wa Misili ija yamwikile yawe mkulu wa isi ija na muing'anda ya ufaume. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Labaho, kulawilila nzala ng'hulu muisi yose ya Misili na Kanani, igalile gayo kulu nao wasaho wetu hawadahile kupata ndia. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Mbali Yakobo viyahulike uko Misili kukala na ndia kawalagiza wanage manake wasaho zetu waite Misili kwa mala ya mosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Viwaitile kaidi Yusufu kaitambula kwa wakulu zake na Falao mfaume wa Misili kawamanya waja wakulu zake Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Baho Yusufu kawalagiza wamgale Misili Yakobo tataake hamwe na walukolo zake wose, nao wakala wanhu sabini na tano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ivo Yakobo kahulumuka kuita isi ya Misili kuja iyo na wasaho zetu wadanganika. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mitufi yao ibwelezigwa mbaka Shekemu, na kuwandigwa mdipanga dija diguligwe kwa sente na Ibulahimu kulawa kwa wanage Hamoli.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Chipindi cha Mulungu kutenda laliko jake diyamwing'ile Ibulahimu vuukalile behi kuvika wanhu wetu wagendelela kongezeka ng'hani uko Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Haichikomelezo kengila mfaume imwenga ija hamanyile chochose kwa mbuli ya Yusufu kasonga kulongoza isi ya Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mfaume iyo kasonga kuwadununza wasaho zetu kawashwangiza wawaleke kunze wana wao ili wadanganike. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa kavumbuka mchipindi icho, kakala mwana mnovu ng'hani. Tata na mami yake wamlela ukae kwa miezi midatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Viwamwikile kutali na hakae biti Falao kamsola na kumlela kama mwanage mwenyego. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa kafundigwa nzewele zose za Misili, kakala galu kwa ulonzi na sang'hano.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Viyavikize milao alubaini kalonda kuita kuwalola walukolo wake uko Izilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kamona muizilaeli miyage kodununzigwa na munhu wa Misili, Musa kamsunha na kumkoma ili kumlihiza chisasi kwa kumonela muizilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Kagiza kua ndugu zake wovimanya kua Mulungu kowalohola kubitila iyo, mbali ndugu zake hawavimanyile. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Igolo yake kawaona Waizilaeli waidi wogomba kageza kuwalamula kalonga, ‘Mweye wanhu mwa ndugu habali mogomba ivo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ija yakalile komtoa miyage, kamsung'ha Musa hamgwazo na kumlongela, ‘Yelihi yakwikile kua chilongozi na mlamuzi wetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ivo, kolonda kung'oma kama vuumkomile ija mmisili igolo.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa viyahulike mbuli izo, kakimbilila uko Midiani kuyakalile kama nyambenyambe, na kalela wana waidi wa chilume.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Viibitile milao alubaini, Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlawila Musa mchisolo chikalile chokwaka moto kuja kuchiwala behi na lugongo lwa Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa viyaionile mbuli iyo kakanganya ng'hani, kakikwesela behi chija chisolo ili yakilole goya kamhulika Mndewa Mulungu viyamlongela, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Niye ni Mulungu wa wasaho zako, Mulungu wa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.’ Musa kadumba na kugudema na hagezile kwinula chihanga chake. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Baho Mndewa kamlongela, ‘Vula makwabaza gako kwa vija hanhu hanho wimile ni hanhu hangu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Kweli niwaona wanhu wangu viwadununzika nihulika ndilo yao na nihulumuka niwalohole, lelo nokulagiza Misili.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Musa iyo ija wanhu wa Izilaeli wamlemile viwalongile, ‘Yelihi yakwikile kua chilongozi na mlamuzi wetu?’ Mulungu kamtumila mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu ija yamlawile muichisolo chikalile chokwaka moto kumlagiza Musa yawe chilongozi na mlohozi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Iyo yawalongoze waja wanhu kulawa Misili kwa kusang'hana miujiza na uzonza, muiisi ya Misili na muibahali ya Shamu. Ivija kawalongoza wanhu mchiwala kwa milao alubaini. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Ino iyo ija Musa yawalongele Waizilaeli, ‘Mulungu kokwiza kuwenulila mlagusi kama niye kulawa kwa mulukolo wenu wenyego.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Musa yakalile muuting'hanilo wa wanhu ukalile kuluwala haja mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu viyalongile nayo hamwe na tata zetu kulugongo lwa Sinai, nayo kabokela mbuli za ugima ili yaching'he cheye. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Mbali wavele wetu walema kumtegeleza Musa, wamlema na walonda kubweleganya Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamulongela Haluni, ‘Chitendele milungu yonda ichilongoze mnzila, manake hachimanyile gaja gampatile Musa yachilongoze kulawa Misili.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Chipindi icho icho chiwatendile nyang'iti yaigalile na gung'hundila da ng'ombe, wailavila nhosa ya kulukuzigwa na kumvinila lusona iyo nyang'iti iwatendile kwa makono gao wenyego. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ivo Mulungu viyasegele hamwao, kawaleka wafugamile nhondo za kuulanga, kama viyandikigwe mchitabu cha walagusi wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli! Ivo, sio niye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">mnichinjile wanyama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">na kunilavila nhosa ya kulukuza kwa milao alubaini kuluwala.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mchipapa chiheha cha mulungu Moleki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na nyang'iti ya nhondo ya mulungu wenu Lefani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">imutendile ili kuifugamila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">kwa mbuli iyo nowagala mmahame kutali kubita Babeli.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Wavele wetu viwakalile kuja kulawala wakala na hema kama chilaguso kua Mulungu kahamwe nao. Wadizenga hema ijo kama Mulungu viyamulagize Musa kudizenga. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Wavele wetu waibokela hema iyo mbaka chipindi cha Yoshua viwaisolile isi ija kulawa kwa wanhu waja Mulungu yawawingile haulongozi wao, hema iyo ikala baho mbaka chipindi cha Daudi.<verse eid="ACT 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi kapata ng'hekewa kulawa kwa Mulungu kampula Mulungu chibali cha kumzengela ng'anda ili iyo na Waizilaeli wose wamfugamile umo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Mbali Selemani iyo yamzengele Mulungu ng'anda iyo.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Hataivo, Iyo yali Kuchanha ng'hani hakala mzing'anda zizengigwe na wanhu kama vija mlagusi wa Mulungu viyalongile,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Kuulanga uko kuchigoda changu cha ufaume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na muiisi ni hanhu ha kwika magulu gangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ivo, monizengela ng'anda yavilihi?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ivo, hanhu hangu hakukala halihi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ivo, sio niye nivilumbile vinhu vose?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Stefano kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye mwa wadulu, mioyo yenu na magutwi genu ni kama ga wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu. Momlema Muhe wa Mulungu kama viwatendile wasaho zetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Walagusi wa Mulungu wose wasaho zetu wawamdununza. Wawakoma hata waja walongile kwa mbuli ya kwiza kwake ija yosang'hana gaja goyolonda Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mweye iyo muibokele ija ndagizi igaligwe na Watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu mbali hamuitegeleze!”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefano kotoigwa mabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Waja vilongozi wa chitala viwahulike gago wagevuzika ng'hani na waluma meno kwa ludoko. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Mbali Stefano kuno kamema Muhe wa Mulungu, kalola kuulanga kaona bung'hulo da ukulu wa Mulungu na Yesu kema ubanzi wa nhogolwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Labaho kalonga, “Loleni noona ulanga ufunhuligwa! Na Mwana wa Munhu kema ubanzi wa nhogolwa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Baho wanhu wose wakalile haja mchitala watoa nyangi na kusita magutwi gao, amala wose wamvamila hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Wamulava kunze wamgala kutali kulawa mzikae wasonga kumtoa mabwe. Waja walongile uvwizi kwa mbuli yake wavula migolole yao na kwika hammagulu ga mbwanga imwe yokemigwa Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Viwakalile womtoa mabwe, Stefano kalonga, “Mndewa Yesu bokela muhe wangu!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kafugama mavindi, na kulila kwa dizi kulu kuno yolonga, “Mndewa walekesele malozo gano gawatenda!” Viyamalile kulonga gago kadanganika.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sauli ivija kaona mbuli iyo ya kumkoma Stefano kuwa inoga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli kasonga kuwadununza wamtogole Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Zua ijo wanhu wamtogole Kilisito kulawa Yelusalemu wasonga kudununzigwa vihile. Wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisito wasonga kupwililika, na kukimbilila mzikae za Yudea na Samalia, mbali wasenga wa Mulungu wasigala. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wanhu womfugamila Mulungu wamuwanda Stefano na kumlilila n'ni.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Sauli kagendelela kuwadununza wanhu waja wamtogole Kilisito, kakala yokwingila chila ng'anda na kuwabulula wanachike kwa walume na kuwagela mdigeleza.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo koligula Usenga Unogile uko Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Wanhu wao wapwililike waita chila hanhu kuligula Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Nayo Filipo katelemkila muikae ya Samalia na kuwaligulila wanhu mbuli ya Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Wanhu viwamuhulike Filipo na kuona miujiza iyatendile, wamtegeleza goya gayalongile. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Vinyamkela viwalawa wanhu kuno wotoa nyangi, na wanhu wengi wakalile waholola lukuli wahonyigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ivo wanhu wa kae ija wadeng'helela ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Hakala na munhu imwe muikae ija yokemigwa Simoni. Iyo kakala yotenda uhawi kwa chipindi chitali na kuwazaganya wanhu wa kae ya Samalia, kailagusa kua iyo munhu yamanyike. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Wanhu wose, wakulu kwa wadodo, wamtegeleza goya kuno wolonga, “Munhu ino iyo udaho wa Mulungu ikemegwa, ‘Udaho mkulu,’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wamtegeleza kwavija kwa chipindi chitali kawazaganya kwa uhawi wake. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Mbali viwautogole Usenga Unogile wa ufaume Mulungu na usenga wa Yesu Kilisito uja uliguligwe na Filipo, wose wabatizigwa walume kwa wake. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni nayo kamtogola Kilisito na kubatizigwa, kamuwinza Filipo chila hayoita na kazaganyika ng'hani kwa miujiza na uzonza uyaonile.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Waja watumigwa wa Mulungu wakalile kuja Yelusalemu viwahulike kua Wasamalia wabokela usenga wa Mulungu wawalagiza Petulo na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nao viwavikile uko wawapulila ili wabokele Muhe wa Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwavija Muhe wa Mulungu kakala yang'hali hanamwingila munhu yoyose manake wabatizigwa kwa zina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Baho, Petulo na Yohana wawekila makono waja wamtogole Yesu Kilisito, nao wambokela Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni viyaonile kua wanhu wekiligwe makono na wasenga wa Mungu wobokela Muhe wa Mulungu kalonda kuweng'ha sente, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />yolonga, “Ning'heni na nie udaho uno ivija ili chila munhu nonda kumwikila makono gangu yambokele Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Mbali Petulo kamwidika, “Segela hano na sente yako kwavija kutoga kua kodaha kugula nhunza ya Mulungu kwa sente! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Hudaha kuilumba na cheye muisang'hano ino kwavija muhe wako wotonga vihile kwambuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kwaivo, ulonge na kuleka malozo gano na umpule Mndewa kodaha kukulekesela gautonga mmoyo wako, <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />kwavija noona kolumila ng'hani na malozo gakugoga kama mfungigwa.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni kalonga, “Mnipulile mweye kwa Mndewa ili sekeganipate gago gamlonga.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Labaho Petulo na Yohana viwakomeleze kuwalongela gaja gawaonile kwambuli Yesu na kuwalongela usenga wa Mndewa, wasonga kubwela Yelusalemu. Viwakalile nzila wakala woligula Usenga Unogile mvijiji vingi va isi Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo kombatiza mkulu imwe kulawa Isiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamulongela Filipo, “Genda ubanzi wa hasi kuinzila ilawa Yelusalemu kuita Gaza.” Nzila iyo ikala kuchiwala. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Baho Filipo kasonga mwanza na viyakalile mnzila kamuona mkulu imwe wa isi ya Isiopia iyo yakalile kahasigwa, munhu iyo kakala mwika usigavu muing'anda ya Kandake, malikila wa Isiopia. Mkulu iyo kakala yaitile Yelusalemu kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Viyakalile nzila mumtuka wake ukalile wokwegigwa na mnyama yokemigwa Falasi viyobwela ukae, kakala yosoma chitabu chandikigwe na Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muhe wa Mulungu kamlongela Filipo,“Uwinze mtuka uo na ukale behi nao.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Baho Filipo kaukimbilila mtuka uja na kamuhulika munhu iyo kosoma chitabu cha Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu. Filipo kamuuza mkulu ija, “Ivo kochimanya icho chiusoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Munhu iyo kamwidika, “Nodahaze kugamanya bila munhu kuni fambulila?” Baho kampula Filipo yakwele mumtuka yakale hamwe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Mayandiko gayakala yosoma munhu iyo iyo gano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Iyo kakala kama bung'hukilalo yagaligwa kuchinjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">kakala kama gung'hundila da nhondolo viyakanhigwa mazoya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">Nayo kanyamala hupi halongile chinhu.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Wamuonela na kugeligwa chinyala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">habule munhu yadahile kuulongelela ulelo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwavija ugima wake usegezigwa muiisi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Iyo mkulu wa Isiopia kamlongela Filipo, “Nokupula nongele mlagusi ino wa Mulungu kolongelela mbuli zake hebu za munhu imwenga?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Baho, Filipo kwa kutumila Mayandiko gaja kamfambulila Usenga Unogile wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Viwakalile wang'hali wogendelela na mwanza, wavika hanhu heli na mazi ija mkulu wa Isiopia kamuuza Filipo,“Ulole hano hana mazi, ivo chilihi chinhende nileke kubatizigwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo kamlongela,“Uhawa kotogola kwa moyo wako wose kodaha kubatizigwa.” Nayo kedika, “Notogola kua Yesu Kilisito ni Mwana wa Mulungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Filipo kamlongela,“Uhawa kotogola kwa moyo wako wose kodaha kubatizigwa.” Nayo kedika, “Notogola kua Yesu Kilisito ni Mwana wa Mulungu.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mayandiko gamwenga gabule msitali uno. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ivo ija mkulu kamlongela ija mlongoza mtuka yeme, watelemka na kwingila mmazi, nayo Filipo kambatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Viwalawile mmazi bahaja Muhe wa Mndewa kamsola Filipo. Mkulu ija hamuone kaidi Filipo mbali kagendelela na mwanza kuno yeli na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo nayo kaivika kakuikae ya Azoto, kabita mzikae zose kuno yoligula Usenga Unogile mbaka viyavikile Kaisalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli komtogola Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Sang’hano za Wasenga 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mumsimo uo Paulo kakala yokongeza kuwatenda wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wadumbe ng'hani kwakuwalongela kokwiza kuwakoma. Ivo kaita kwa mkulu wa Walava nhambiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Kapula yamwing'he balua ili yatambuligwe na vilongozai wa ng'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kae ya Damasiko ili yahavika uko yawagoge walume na wana chike, waja woiwinza Nzila ya Mndewa, na yawagale Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ila Sauli viakalile behi na kuvika kae ya Damasiko, baho lumwesa kulawa kuulanga umbung'hulila ubanzi wose. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kagwa hasi na kuhulika dizi, “Sauli, Sauli! Habali undununza?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Baho Sauli kamuuza, “Gweye kwa nani Mndewa?” Nayo kedika, “Niye iyo Yesu undununza.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Mbali sambi ima, wingile muikae na gweye kolongiligwa chiulondeka kusang'hana.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wanhu wakalile muumwanza na Sauli, wema kuno wabule chakulonga, kwavija wahulika dizi mbali hawamonile ija yolonga. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli kenuka, na viyagezile kulola hadahile kuona chochose, baho wamwamha mkono wamlongoza mbaka kae ya Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Nayo kakala mazua madatu bila kuona chochose, na hadile hebu kung'wa chinhu chochose.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Hakala na mjalusona wa Yesu muikae ya Damasiko yakemigwe Anania. Mndewa, kamkema mgamaloleso,“Anania!” Nayo kedika, “Nahano, Mndewa,” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mndewa kamulongela Anania, “Itande uite hanhu hokemigwa nzila igoloke, uite muing'anda ya Yuda ukamuuze munhu imwe kulawa Taliso yokemigwa Sauli, na sambi kompula Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />nayo mgamaloleso kamuona munhu imwe yokemigwa Anania kokwingila muing'anda na kumwikila makono ili yeze kuona kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Mbali Anania kedika, “Mndewa wanhu wengi wanilongela kwambuli ya iyo Sauli viyawatendile vihile wanhu wako uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Sambi kahano, wakulu wa walava nhambiko wamwing'ha udahi cha kuwagoga wose waja woditogola zina jako.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Mbali Mndewa kamulongela, “Gweye genda tu, kwavija munhu iyo nimsagula yawe mtumigwa wangu yawaligulile zina jangu kwa wanhu waja haweli Wayahudi na wafaume na wanhu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Niye nomlagusila vija vonda yadununzike kwambuli ya zina jangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Baho, Anania kaita, kengila muing'anda iyo, kamwikila Sauli makono kalonga, “Mbwigaangu Sauli,” Mndewa Yesu yakulawile mnzila kanilagiza kumwako ili udahe kuona kaidi na kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Bahaja vinhu kama vibale vilagala kulawa mmeso ga Sauli, baho kasonga kuona kaidi. Amala kema na kubatizigwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />na viyakomeleze kuja ndia ludabwa lwake lumbwelela.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli koligula uko Damasiko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli kakala mazua madodo hamwe na wamtogole Kilisito wa uko Damesiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Baho kasonga kuligula usenga unogile kua Yesu ni Mwana wa Mulungu Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wanhu wose wamhulike Sauli wakanganya na kuuza, “Ivo, munhu ino sio ija yawakomile waja wakalile wopula kwa zina da Yesu kuja Yelusalemu? Ivo, hezile hano ili yawagoge waja wamtogole Yesu na kuwagala kwa wakulu wa Walava nhambiko?<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Baho Sauli kagendelela kupata ugalu wa kuligula usenga wa Mulungu na kuwatenda Wayahudi wengi wakalile kae ya Damesiki wamkanganye kwa kugangamiza kua Yesu ni Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Mazua mengi vigabitile, Wayahudi waikunzanya na kumwikila chigwena cha kumkoma Sauli, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />mbali Sauli kalongeligwa mbuli iyo. Ivo Wayahudi waimila milwivi mikulu ya kwingilila misi na chilo ili wamkome. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Mbali ichilo wajalusona wa Sauli wamsola na wamwika mumgelo mkulu na kumhulumusa kubitila zonzo dili mchiambaza cha kae.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kobwela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli viyavikile Yelusalemu na kageza kuilumba na waluko wa Yesu, mbali waluko wose wa Yesu wamdumba hawatogole kua iyo kakala mwaluko. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Amala Banaba keza na kamsola Sauli kamgala kwa wasenga wa Mulungu na kuwafambulila vija Sauli viyamuonile Mndewa na vija Mndewa viyamlongele viyakalile mnzila. Banaba ivija kawalongela vija Sauli viyaligule kwa ugalu zina da Yesu uko Damesiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Baho, Sauli kakala hamwe nao, kagenda muikae yose ya Yelusalemu yoligula usenga wa Mndewa bila kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kalongelela na kuibelela na Wayahudi waja wolonga ulonzi wa Chiyunani, mbali wao walonda kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ndugu wamtogole Kilisito viwaimanyile mbuli ino, wamsola Sauli wamgala Kaisalea, wamleka aite kumwao Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Kwaivo bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Yesu wakala na utindiwala mu Yudea yose na Galilaya na Samalia. Muhe wa Mulungu kawagangamiza na kuwagela moyo wongezeka kukala kwa kumtegeleza Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo mzikae za Lidda na Yafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petulo viyakalile yogenda hanhu hakwe hakwe kaita kuwalola wanhu wa Mulungu wakalile wokala muikae ya Lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Uko kamvika munhu imwe yokemigwa Ainea, iyo kwa milao minane kakala yawasile mdikomwa kwavija kakala yaholole. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Baho, Petulo kamulongela,“Ainea, Yesu Kilisto kokuhonya. Lamuka kunzanya chilago chako uite.” Bahaja Ainea kalamuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wanhu wose wokala muikae ya Lidda na konde da Shaloni wamona Ainea na wose wamtogola Mndewa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Muikae ya Yafa kukala na mwaluko imwe wa Yesu yakemigwe Tabita, Zina jake kwa Chiyunani ni Dolikasi, manake mhala. Mwanachike imwe kakala yosang'hana ganogile na kuwataza vikumbi muyega mazua gose. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Chipindi icho kaugula na kadanganika, wanhu wausunha mtufi wake wawika mdigati da golofa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yofa hahakalile hatali na kae ya Lidda waluko viwahulike kua Petulo kauko, wawalagiza wanhu waidi waite kumwake na kumpula, “Chonde chokupula lopola wizo kuno. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Baho Petulo kasegela, kaita hamwe nao. Viyavikile, kagaligwa kung'anda kudigolofa. Uko wagane wengi wamzunguluka Petulo kuno wolila na kumlagusila makoti na vivalo viyakalile yovisona Dolikasi viyakalile mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petulo kawalava wose kuja mgati, amala kafugama mavindi kapula, kauhindukila uja mtufi kalonga, “Tabita lamuka.” Nayo kafumbula meso gake na viyamonile Petulo kalamuka kakala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petulo kamwamha mkono na kumwinula, amala kawakema waja wanhu wa Mulungu hamwe na waja wagane kamleka kumwao yeli mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Mbuli iyo yenela chila hanhu uko kuikae ya Yofa, na wanhu wengi wamtogola Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petulo kasigala Yafa kwa mazua mengi, kakala kwa munhu imwe galu wa kusang'hana vinhu va mbende yakemigwe Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petulo na Kolinelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kukala na munhu imwe uko Kaisalea yokemigwa Kolinelio, munhu iyo kakala mkulu wa chikosi cha wamilizi chikemigwe, “Chikosi cha Kaisalia.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Iyo na wanhu wa ukae yake wakala womtegeleza Mulungu. Kakala yompula Mulungu mazua gose na kuwataza ng'hani vikumbi muyega. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Zua dimwe kama saa tisa chigulogulo, kaona maloleso, kamuona mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga, yomuwinza na kumkema, “Kolinelio!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolinelio kambunhulila meso kuno yodumba kalonga, “Gomkulu kuna choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Iyo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlongela, “Mulungu katogola pulo jako na kaona nhosa zako kwa vikumbi muyega, kadi hazisemwa mazua gose. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Sambi, walagize wanhu waite Yafa wakamkeme munhu imwe zina jake Simoni hebu yokemigwa Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Iyo kokala ukae kwa Simoni msang'hanaji wa vinhu va mbende, iyo ng'anda yake yabehi na bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Iyo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu yakalile yolonga nayo viyasegele, Kolinelio kawakema watumigwa wake waidi hamwe na mmilizi imwe yomtegeleza Mulungu, ija yakalile imwe mwa watazi wake yakalile mmilizi wake wa behi ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kolinelio kawalongela mbuli zose zilawilile amala kawalagiza waite Yafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Igolo yake saa sita imisi wanhu wao viwakalile mmabehi na kae ya Yafa imisi Petulo kakwela kuchanha kudilingo kupula. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Viyakalile yopula kaona nzala kalonda yapate ndia. Ndia viikalile yokwambikigwa kaona maloleso. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kaona ulanga ugubuligwa na chinhu kama golole kulu chohulumusigwa chihawa chigogigwa mhindo zose nne. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mgati yake kukala na aina zose za wanyama wakalile na magulu mane na wotambala na ndege. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Amala kahulika dizi,”Petulo ima na uchinje uje!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petulo kalonga, “Habule Mndewa, sinakuja chinhu chochose mwiko hebu ndia imtenda munhu seke yatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Kaihulika kaidi dizi, “Chinhu chija Mulungu chiyalongile chodaha kujigwa, seke ulonge kua mwiko kujigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Mbuli iyo ilawilila mala nhatu amala golole dija dibwelezigwa kuulanga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petulo viyakalile yan'li koiuza, maloleso gago manake choni, waja wanhu watumigwe na Kolinelio, viwakalile waimanya ng'anda ya Simoni wavika haulwivi. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Watoa hodi wauza, “Ivo, hano hana nyambenyambe yokemigwa Simoni Petulo?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petulo viyakalile yang'hali yotonga kwambuli ya gaja maloleso Muhe wa Mulungu kamulongela, “Simoni, hano hana wanhu wadatu wokuzambwila. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />“Hulumuka na uite nao bila kuiuza, kwavija nie iyo niwalagize.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Baho, Petulo kahulumuka na kuwalongela waja wanhu, “Nie iyo munizambwila. Habali mwiza?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Wanhu waja wamwidikila, “Chilagizigwa na Kolinelio,” ija mkulu wa wemilizi. “Iyo munhu mtendagoya yomtegeleza Mulungu, na Wayahudi wose womtegeleza. Iyo kalagizigwa na mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu yakugoneke ukae yake ili yategeleze gaja gonda umlongele.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petulo kawalongela wengile mng'anda na kawen' hakuwasa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Igolo yake kasegela hamwe nao, kuno woilongoza na ndugu wamwenga womtogola Kilisito kulawa Yafa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Zua da kaidi wavika Kaisalia na uko Kolinelio kakala yowabeta hamwe na ndugu zake na mbwiga zake. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petulo viyakalile yokwingila, Kolinelio kalawa kunze kumbokela, kamfugamila mavindi na kuidulika hasi kwa kumtogola. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Mbali Petulo kamwinula na kumulongela, “Ima, nie ivija na munhu tu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petulo kagendelela kulongelela na Kolinelilo kuno wokwingila mng'anda muja yawavikile wanhu wengi waikunzanye.” <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Petulo kawalongela, “Mweye mvimanya kabisa kua ndagizi yetu Wayahudi yochigoma kuilumba na munhu ija heli Muyahudi hebu kuita kumtembelela. Mbali Mulungu kanilongela seke nimgese munhu yoyose kua hatogoligwa nayo hebu hanang'hane. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ivo, vumnikemile niza bila kuiuza, sambi nonda nivimanye habali mng'hema?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolinelio kalonga, “Saa kama zino mazua madatu kabitile ng'hala nopula mng'anda yangu ikala kama saa tisa chigulogulo. Bahaja munhu yavalile vivalo vizelu chwee! Kanimila haulongozi hangu <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />na kalonga, ‘Kolinelio! Mulungu kahulika kupula kwako na nhosa ziuweng'ha vikumbi muyenga Mulungu hazisemwile. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Walagize wanhu waite Yofa kwa munhu yokemigwa Simon kwazina dimwenga kokemigwa Petulo. Iyo yeli muing'anda ya Simoni msang'hana vinhu va mbende, yokala behi na bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Kwaivo nilopola kulagizila wanhu wakukeme, na kutenda goya kwiza. Sambi chose cha hano haulongozi wa Mulungu, kutegeleza chochose chija Mndewa chiyakulagiza kulonga.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga na wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Baho Petulo kasonga kulonga, “Sambi nivimanya kabisa kua kweli Mulungu habagula na komsang'hala chila munhu kuilinga na imwenga. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Munhu wa isi yoyose yomtegeleza Mulungu na kusang'hana gaja galondigwa nayo, iyo kobokeligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mweye moumanya uja usenga Mulungu yaugalile kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli, uligula Usenga Unogile ugala utindiwala kubitila Yesu Kilisito yeli Mndewa wa wose. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mweye mvimavya gaja gose galawilile muiisi yose ya Wayahudi kusoga Galilaya, Yohana viyasongile kuligula mbuli ya kubatiza. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mummanya Yesu wa Nazaleti na vija Mulungu viyamsagule na kumwaing'ha Muhe wake na udaho. Kakala yogenda chila hanhu yosang'hana ganogile na kuwahonya wanhu wose waoneligwe na Mwenembago, kwavija Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Cheye chigaona gago gose gayasang'hane muiisi ya Yudea na muikae ya Yelusalemu. Wamkoma na kumuwamba mumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ila Mulungu kamzilibula zua da kadatu, amala kamtenda yaoneke na wanhu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />haoneke kwa chila munhu, mbali kwa waja tu wasaguligwe na Mulungu wamuone nao iyo cheye chisaguligwe kuja na kung'wa hamwe nayo viyazilibuke. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kachilagiza kuuligula Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wose na kuwalongela gaja gachionile kua Yesu iyo yasaguligwe na Mulungu yawe mlamuzi wa wagima na wafile. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Walagusi wose wa Mulungu walongelela kwambuli yake kua chila munhu yomtogola, kolekeseligwa malozo gake gose kwa zina jake.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa isi zimwenga wobokela Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Chipindi Petulo viyakalile yogendelela kulonga mbuli izo, Muhe wa Mulungu kawezila wose wakalile wotegeleza usenga uo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Waja Wayahudi wamtogole Kilisito wezile hamwe na Petulo kulawa Yofa wakanganya kuona kua Mulungu kaweng'ha nhunza ya Muhe wake wanhu wa isi zimwenga. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Wavimanya ivo kwavija wawahulika wolonga kwa ulonzi umwenga wa nhogolwa kwa Mulungu. Baho Petulo kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Wanhu wano wambokela Muhe wa Mulungu kama cheye wenyego vichimbokele. Ivo, hana munhu yoyose yodaha kuwakimila wanhu wano sekewabatizigwe kwa mazi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Baho kalagiza wanhu wabatizigwe kwa zina da Yesu Kilisito. Amala wanhu waja wampula Petulo yakale nao kwa mazua madodo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga viyalagizigwe kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wasenga wa Mulungu na waja wamwenga wambokele Yesu kuja Yudea wahulika kua wanhu haweli Wayahudi nao wabokela usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Baho, Petulo viyakwelile kuita Yelusalemu, waja Wayahudi wamtogole Kilisito wengile kumbi, wasonga kumlonga Petulo, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />wolonga, “Gweye kuita kukala mzing'anda za wanhu waja hawengile kumbi na mbaka kuja nao!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Baho, Petulo kasonga kuwalongela mbuli zose vizilawilile kusongela haumwanduso kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Nikala muikae ya Yafa nipula, bahaja mhata utulo lovulovu na niona maloleso. Hakala na chinhu kama golole kulu dohulumuka kulawa kuulanga dikala jamhigwa mhindo zake nne, najo dinizila behi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Vinilolile goya mgati yake niona wanyama wa magulu mane, wanyama wa kuimbago na waja wotambala na ndege. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Amala nihulika dizi,”Petulo lamuka uchinje uje!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Mbali nie nilonga, “Habule Mndewa, sinakuja chinhu chochose chili mwiko kujigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Dija dizi dihulikigwa kaidi kulawa kuulanga, “Chinhu chija Mulungu chiyalongile kodaha kuja, seke ukilonge mwiko kujigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Mbuli iyo ilawilila mala nhatu, amala ivo vose vibwelezigwa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Bahaja, wanhu wadatu wakalile watumigwa kumwangu kulawa Kaisalia wavika kuing'anda ing'halile nokala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muhe wa Mulungu kanilagiza niite hamwe nao bila kuiuza. Wao ndugu sita wailongoza na nie na chose chingila kwa iyo Kolinelio. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Iyo kachisimulila vija viyamuone mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu viyemile kuing'anda yake na kumlongela, “Lagiza wanhu waite Yafa wakamkeme Simoni yokemigwa Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Iyo kokwiza kokulongela mbuli ija ikutenda gweye na waja wokala muing'anda yako mloholigwe. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Navinisongile tu kulongelela, Muhe wa Mulungu kawahulumukila kama viyachihulumukile cheye haumwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Nanie siusemwile usenga wa Mndewa Yesu uyalongile, ‘Yohana kabatiza wanhu kwa mazi mbali mweye mobatizigwa kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Baho, ihawa Mulungu kaweng'ha wanhu wano nhunza iija iyaching'ile cheye chimtogole Mndewa Yesu Kilisito, ivo nie nani mbaka nigeze kumlema Mulungu?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Viwahulike ivo waleka kumbelela Petulo na wamwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu walonga, “Mulungu kaweng'ha nyafasi wanhu wa isi zimwenga walonge na kuleka malozo na kuweng'ha ugima!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito uko Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Madununzo galawilile viyadanganike Stefano wanhu wengi wamtogole Kilisito wapwililika, wamwenga waita isi ya Foinike na isi ya Kiplo na wamwenga Antiokia, uko kose wakala woligula usenga wa Yesu kwa Wayahudi waiyeka. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Mbali wamwenga wakala wanhu wa Kiplo na Kilene waitile Antiokia wauligule uo usenga kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga, ivija wawaligulila Usenga Unogile wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mndewa kawataza na wanhu wengi wautogola usenga na kumbwelela Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Mbuli zino ziwavikila bumbila da wamtogole Yesu weli Yelusalemu ivo wamlagiza Banaba yaite Antokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Nayo viyavikile uko kaona vija Mulungu viyaweng'ile unovu wake, kadeng'helela ng'hani na kuwagela moyo wagendelele kua wanhu wakusang'hana gaja goyolonda Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banaba kakala munhu yanogile na yalongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu na kumtogola ng'hani Kilisito. Bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito jongezeka kua wengi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Amala Banaba kaita kae ya Taso kumzambwila Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Nayo viyamonile kamgala Antiokia. Wose waidi wakala na bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito mlao wose na kuwafunda wanhu wengi ng'hani. Uko Antiokia uko chanduso cha waluko wa Yesu kukemigwa Wakilisito<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Chipindi icho walagusi wa Mulungu wavika kulawa Yelusalemu mbaka Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Imwe mmwao yokemigwa Agabo kema na kwa udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu kalonga kua yolawila nzala ng'hulu muiisi yose. Nzala iyo iza kulawilila mfaume wa Kaisalia yokemigwa Kilaudio viyakalile yolongoza. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Waja waluko wa Yesu waitogolela chila munhu yagale chochose kuilinga na chieli nacho ili chiwataze waja ndugu wakalile wokala Yudea. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Baho, watenda ivo na kuweng'ha Banaba na Sauli chija chiwakunzanye wachivikize wao wenyego kwa wakulu wa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Wamtogole Kilisito wodununzigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mchipindi icho icho mfaume Helode Agilipa kasonga kuwadununza wamtogole Kilisito wamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kalagiza Yakobo mkulu wake Yohana yakomigwe kwa kukanhigwa na panga. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Viyaonile mbuli iyo iwanogela Wayahudi kalagiza wamgoge na Petulo. Mbuli ino ilawila mchipindi cha lusona lwa migate igeligwe mela. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Viwamgogile, Petulo wamwika mdigeleza mvikosi vine vimiligwe na wamilizi wane wane ili wamwamile. Helode kalonda uhamala lusona lwa pasaka, amlave ha wanhu ili yalamuligwe. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Baho, Petulo kekigwe mdigeleza, mbali wamtogole Kilisito wasonga kumpulila ng'hani kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu komlava Petulo mdigeleza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ichilo vidikalile ding'hali zua da Helode da kumlava Petulo haulongozi ha wanhu, Petulo kakala yawasile hagati ha wamilizi waidi yeli kafungigwa na minyololo midi. Nao wamilizi wakala wokwamila lango kulu da geleza. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bahaja mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kema behi nayo, na muja mgati mulawilila bung'hulo, ija mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamwamha mulubavu kamulamusa kalonga, “Lopola wime.” Bahaja minyololo ija idumuka mmakogo ga Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kalonga, “Vala msipi wako na makwabaza gako.” Petulo katenda kama viyalongeligwe, amala mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kalonga, “Vala koti jako uniwinze.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petulo kalawa mdigeleza kuno yoilongoza na mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, hamanyile kama gaja galawilile ni kweli, kagesa kakala mmaloleso. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wabita hanhu ha mosi na hakaidi ha wimilizi, labaho wavika haulwivi wa zuma wakwingilila muikae. Lwivi ijo da zuma divuguka denyego nao walawa kunze. Viwakalile wogenda muinzila imwe bahaja ija mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamleka Petulo yaiyeka.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Baho iyo Petulo kavimanya gamulawilile kalonga, “Sambi nivimanya kweli kua Mndewa kamlagiza mtumigwa wake keza kunilohola mmakono ga Helode na kulawa kwa gehile gaja gawalondile kunhendela.<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Viyamanyile ivo kagenda dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka ukae kwa Malia mami yake Yohana yokemigwa Maluko. Umo wanhu wengi wakala waikunzanye kuno wopula. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petulo viyatoile hodi haulwivi wa kunze mtumwa wa chike yokemigwa Loda, keza kumtegeleza. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Viyaditambule dizi da Petulo kadeng'helela ng'hani kabwela bila kuvugula lwivi na kuwalongela Petulo kahanze haulwivi. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Wamulongela ija mndele, “Kuna chichala!” Mbali iyo kagangamiza kua ni kweli nao wamlongela, “Iyo mtumigwa wake wa kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Mbali Petulo kagendelela kutoa hodi nao viwavugule lwivi na kumuona Petulo wakanganya. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petulo kalava chilaguso kwa makono ili wanyamale, kawalongela vija Mndewa viyamlavile mdigeleza. Amala kawalongela, “Mlongeleni Yakobo na ndugu wamwenga womtogola Kilisito.” Labaho kalawa kuita hanhu hamwenga.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Vuuchile wamilizi wakala wodumba ng'hani kwachija chimlawilile Petulo.<verse eid="ACT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode kalagiza Petulo yazambwiligwe chila hanhu mbali hawampatile. Kawauza waja wamilizi na kalava ndagizi wakomigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Labaho Helode kalawa Yudea nakuita kukala kae ya Kaisalia kwa chipindi chidodo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helode Agilipa kodanganika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Helode kakala yehiligwe ng'hani na wanhu wa kae za Tilo na Sidoni, ivo wanhu wa kae izo wailumba hamwe, walonda kuiting'hanila nayo, na viwatogololigwe na Bulasto munhu yatogoligwa ng'hani na mfaume Helode yawe mbwiga wao, wampula Helode wakale nayo kwa utindiwala kwavija isi yao itumanila kupata ndia kulawa muiisi ya mfaume.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Zua dimwe disaguligwe, mfaume Helode kavala vivalo vake va ufaume na kakala mchigoda chake cha ufaume na kulonga na wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Wanhu wakalile waikunzanye waguta nyangi walonga, “Ino sio dizi ya munhu ila ya mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Bahaja mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamtoa Helode na kugwa kwavija hamwing'ile Mulungu nhogolwa iyo.” Baho, ngili imgoga na kadanganika. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Usenga wa Mulungu wenela na kuwavikila wanhu wengi.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Baho Banaba na Sauli viwakomeleze ija sang'hano yao iwagalile, wamsola Yohana yakemigwa Maluko wabwela nayo Antiokia kulawa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Banaba na Sauli wosaguligwa na kutumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mdibumbila da wamtogole Kilisito wa Antiokia kukala na walagusi wamwenga wa Mulungu na wafundaji, mmwao wakala Banaba na Simioni ivija yokemigwa mtitu na Lukio wa Kilene na Manaeni ija yakalile wakulile hamwe na Mfaume Helode Antipasi na Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Wao viwakalile womfugamila Mndewa na kufunga kuja ndia, Muhe wa Mulungu kawalongela, “Nisagulileni Banaba na Sauli kwa mbuli ya sang'hano iniwekile.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Baho, viwakomeleze kufugama na kufunga kuja, wawekila makono Banaba na Sauli na kuilaga amala wawaleka wasegele.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banaba na Sauli uko Kupulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Basi, Muhe wa Mulungu viyamalile kuwatuma Banaba na Sauli, wahulumuka mbaka Seleukia, na viwalawile uko wakwela ngalawa mbaka chisiwa cha Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Viwavikile kuikae ya Salani waligula usenga wa Mulungu Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. Yohana Maluko kakala yowataza muisang'hano yao.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Wagenda kulawa ubanzi umwe wa chisiwa mbaka Pafo ubanzi wa kaidi, na uko wamvika mhawi imwe Myahudi yokemigwa Bali Yesu ija yakalile mlagusi wa uvwizi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Ino kakala mbwiga wa Sagio Paulo, mkulu wa chisiwa ija yakalile na nzewele ng'hani. Sagio Pulo kawagoneka Banaba na Sauli ili yahulike usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Mbali iyo mhawi ija kwa Chiyunani womkema Elima kakala yoibishila na Sauli na Banaba, kageza kumkimila iyo mkulu wa chisiwa sekeyeze kumtogola Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Baho Sauli ija yakemigwe Paulo ivija, kuno kamema Muhe wa Mulungu, kambunhulila meso iyo mhawi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />na kulonga, “Gweye mwana wa Mwenembago! Gweye kwa mhasanyi kohindula chila chinhu chilikweli, mala zose kogeza kuhindula ukweli wa Mndewa kua uvwizi! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Sambi Mndewa kokutoa, na gweye kokua chipofu na hudaha kuona bung'hulo da zua kwa chipindi chidogo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bahaja, meso gake gengila kungugu na ziza, kasonga kuita kuno na kuja kuno kozambwila munhu wa kumgoga mkono yamlongoze. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ija mkulu wa chisiwa viyaonile chija chilawilile, kamtogola Mndewa. Kakanganya ng'hanai kwa uja fundaji yauhulike kwa mbuli ya Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banaba na Paulo muikae ya Antiokia ili Pisidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Baho Paulo na wayage kulawa Pafo, wakwela ngalawa kuita mbaka Peliga uko Pamfulia, mbali Yohana Maluko kawaleka wao na kubwela Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Wao wagendelela na mwanza kulawa Peliga mbaka kae ya Antiokia uko Pisidia. Zua da kuhumula wengila mgati Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kukala.<verse eid="ACT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ndagizi za Musa na Mayandiko ga Walagusi wa Mulungu, gasomigwa, amala vilongozi wa ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi wawagalila usenga Paulo na Banaba walonga, “Ndugu, kama mna mbuli ya kuwalongela wanhu ili kuwagela moyo basi, walongeleni.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Basi Paulo kema na kulava chilaguso kwa mkono na kasonga kulonga, “Mweye Waizilaeli wayangu na wamwenga wose mumfugamila Mulungu, nhegelezeni! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mulungu wa wanhu wano wa Izilaeli kawasagula wasao wetu, na kawatenda wanhu wano wawe wanhu weli na ludabwa mkulu viwakalille muisi ya unyambenyambe kuja Misili. Mulungu kawalava uko kwa udaho wake mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />na mmilao alubaini kawafunyila moyo viwakalile kuja kuluwala. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Kawabananga wanhu wa makabila saba ga isi ya Kanani na kuweng'ha wanhu wake isi ija kua isi yao. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Gano gose gakala kwa milao kama mia nne na hamsini,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Kulawa baho Mulugu kaweng'ha walamuzi wawalongoze mbaka chipindi cha Samweli mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Wanhu wapula weng'higwe mfaume, nayo Mulungu kaweng'ha Sauli, mwana wa Kishi wa kabila da Benyamini ija yawalongoze kwa milao alubaini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Mulungu viyakomeleze kumsegeza Sauli, kamsagula Daudi kua mfaume wao. Chino icho chiyalongile Mulungu kwambuli ya Daudi kalonga, ‘Nimona Daudi mwanage Yese munhu younogela moyo wangu ija yonda yasang'hane gaja gose ganilonda yagasang'hane.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kulawa mulukolo wake Daudi, Mulungu kama viyalalike kawagalila wanhu wa Izilaeli mlohozi nayo iyo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesu viyakalile yang'hali hanasonga sang'hano yake, Yohana kawaligulila wanhu wose wa Izilaeli kua waleke malozo gao na kubatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohana viyakomeleze kulonga usenga wake, kawauza wanhu vino, ‘Mweye mogesa niye nani? Niye sio ija Yesu imumlolela. Iyo yokwiza badili yangu niye sifaya hata kupumbumbulula nzabi za makwabaza gake.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Ndugu zangu wa ulelo wa Ibulahimu, na mweye wanhu wa isi zimwenga muufugamila Mulungu! Uno usenga wa ulohozi ugaligwa kumwetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwa vija wenekae wa Yelusalemu na wakulu wao hawammanyile iyo kua Mlohozi, hebu hawamanyile mbuli za walagusi wa mulungu zija zisomigwa chila zua da kuhumula. Baho wazitenda mbuli za walagusi wa Mulungu zivikile kwa kumlamula Yesu mbuli ya ifa. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Hata kama hawapatile mbuli yoyose ya kumlamula yakomgwe, wampula Pilato yalagize yakomigwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Viwakomeleze kutenda gose gandikigwe kwa mbuli yake, viwamkomile Kwa kumuwamba mumsalaba, wamuhulumusa kulawa mumsalaba na kumwika muimhango. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Mbali Mulungu kamzilibula, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />na ivija mmazua mengi, kawalawilila waja wakalile woilongoza nayo kulawa Galilaya mbaka Yelusalemu. Wao iyo wozilonga mbuli zake kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Cheye chiza hano kuwalongela Usenga Unogile, mbuli ija Mulungu yawalalike wasao wetu, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />kachisang'hanila cheye wazukulu zao kwa mbuli ya kumzilibula Yesu. Kama viyandikigwe muizabuli ya kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Gweye iyo mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">na lelo niye iyo tati yako.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kwa vija Mulungu kamzilibula, ili sekeyaole mbe, Mulungu kalonga vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Noweng'ha ganogile gangu na kweli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">zija zinimlalikile Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Enaa, kama viyandikigwe hanu hamwenga muizabuli, ‘Humleka Mnang'hana wako yaole.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Hata Daudi mwenyego kasang'hana mbuli ziyalondile Mulungu mchipindi chake, amala kadanganika na kuwandigwa behi na wavele wake na ivija lukuli lwake uola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Mbali ija yazilibuligwe haolile. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Kwa ivo mweye ndugu zangu, mvimanye kua kwa kubitila ino Yesu, usenga wa kulekeseligwa malozo woliguligwa kumwenu. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Munhu yoyose yomtogola Yesu kolekesiligwa malozo gose, chimhu chija hachidahike mzindagizi za Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ivo, itiganyeni ili sekempatigwe na gaja galongigwe na walagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Mweye mli na zeleu tegelezeni, gendeleleni kukanganya mokwiza kudanganika!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwa vija chinhu chinisang'hana sambi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Sio chimhu chimtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Hata kama yaheza munhu kuwalongeleni!’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Baho Paulo na Banaba viwakalile wolawa Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, waja wanhu wawagoneka kaidi weze Zua dimwenga da kuhumula ili walongelele ng'hani mbuli izo. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Viwakomeleze uja mting'hano wao, Wayahudi wengi na wanhu kulawa isi zimwenga waja wakalile waitogole dini ya Chiyahudi wawawinza Paulo na Banaba. Watumigwa wa Mulungu walonga nao na kuwagela moyo wagendelele kukala kwa kutumanila unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Zua dimwenga da kuhumula vidivikile, wanhu wengi muikae ija keza kutegeleza usenga wa Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Mbali waja Wayahudi viwaonile dija bumbila da wanhu haja, wengila maya, na hawatogole chija chiyalongile Paulo na kumliga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Mbali Paulo na Banaba walongelela kwa ugalu ng'hani kwa kulonga, “Tanhu ilondeka usenga wa Mulungu uwavikile mweye, mbali kwa vija mweye mlema kukala muugima ulibule uhelelo, baho muilamula wenyego, ivo chowaleka na chowagendela wanhu wa isi zimwenga.<verse eid="ACT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Manake Mndewa kachilagiza cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nikwika gweye uwe bung'hulo da wanhu wa isi zimwenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ili uwagalile ulohozi wanhu wa isi zose.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Wanhu haweli Wayahudi viwahulike mbuli iyo wadeng'helela na wautogola uja usenga wa Mulungu, na waja wasaguligwe na Mulungu kukala na ugima ulibule uhelelo wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Baho usenga wa Mndewa wenela chila hanhu muikae ija. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Wayahudi wawashwangiza waja wanachike vilongozi wamfugamila Mulungu, na walume watogoligwa ng'hani muikae iyo. Wasonga kuwadununza Paulo na Banaba na kuwawinga kulawa muikae yao. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Baho wasenga wa Mulungu wakung'hunha tibwisi zikalile mmagulu gao kama nyinukila kumwao na waita Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Mbali waja wajalusona wa Yesu wa muikae ya Antiokia wakala wamemile deng'o na kulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Banaba uko kae ya Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Kuja kae ya Ikonio, Paulo na Banaba waita muikae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, kama mazoela gao, uko waligula kwa udaho mkulu mbaka Wayahudi wengi na wanhu haweli Wayahudi wamtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Mbali Wayahudi wamwenga walemile kumtogola Kilisito, wawashwangiza wanhu wa isi zimwenga ili wawaleme waja wamtogole Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Baho Paulo na Banaba wagendelela kukala uko kwa chipindi chitali. Walongelela kwa ugalu mbuli ya Mndewa, nayo Mndewa kagangamiza ukweli wa usenga waulavile kwa mbuli ya unovu wake, na kuwadahiza wanhu kusang'hana uzonza na miujiza. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Na wanhu wa kae iyo waigola, wamwenga wailumba na Wayahudi na wamwenga wakala ubanzi wa wasenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Haichikomelezo, wanhu wa isi zimwenga na Wayahudi kuno wailumba na wakulu wao wawekila chigwena cha kuwabananga vihile hao wasenga na wawatoa kwa mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Wasenga viwamanyile mbuli iyo, wakimbilila kae za Lusitila na Delibe, zili Lukaonia na hanu hakalile behi nao, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />uko wakala woligula Usenga Unogile.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Banaba uko Lusitila na Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Hakala na munhu imwe mulume yakalile mbetembete uko Lusitila kulawa viyavumbuke, na kakala hapatile kutembela ng'o. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Munhu iyo kakala yomtegeleza Paulo viyakalile yoligula. Nayo Paulo kamlola goya munhu iyo na viyamonile kakala yatogole kuhonyigwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />kalonga kwa dizi kulu, “Ima kwa migulu gako!” Nayo munhu yakalile mbetembete bahaja kenuka kasonga kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Na bumbila da wanhu vidionile chiatendile Paulo, wasonga kutoa nyangi kwa ulonzi wa Chilukaonia, “Chivikiligwa na milungu kwa lumbo da kiunhu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Banaba kakemigwa Zeu zina da mulungu wao mkulu na Paulo kakemigwa mulungu Helime kwavija iyo yakalile mlonzi mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nayo Mkulu wa nhambiko wa mulungu Zeu ija ng'anda yake ya kutambikila ikala hamgwazo chidogo ya kae, kagala malume ya ng'ombe na mashada ya malua haulongozi wa lwivi mkulu lwa kae. Iyo hamwe na dija bumbila da wanhu walonda kuwalavila nhambiko wasenga. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Banaba na Paulo viwapatile mbuli izo, wavidega vivalo vao kulagusa kua wolema mbuli iyo na kukimbilila haja mdibumbila da wanhu na kutoa nyangi walonga, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Mweye wanhu habali mozitenda mbuli zino? Cheye cha wanhu kama mweye. Chahano kuwaligulileni Usenga Unogile, ili muleke ino milungu ya nyang'iti ilibule chinhu, mumhindukile Mulungu yeli na ugima, yalumbilie ulanga na isi, bahali na vinhu vose viliumo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Umwaka Mulungu kawaleka wanhu wose haweli Wayahudi wasang'hane kama viwolonda. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Hamwe na ijo Mulungu halekile kuwasang'hanila mbuli zinogile wanhu wose, kuwatowela mvula kulawa kuulanga na koweng'ha mazao kwa msimo wake, koweng'ha ndia na kowamemeza deng'o mmioyo yenu.”<verse eid="ACT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kwakulonga ivo, Paulo na Banaba, wadaha kuwakimila kwa udala wanhu waja sekewawalavile nhambiko.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Hamwande chidogo Wayahudi wamwenga, weza kulawa uko Antiokia na Ikonio wawatenda wanhu wailumbe hamwe nao, wamtoa mabwe Paulo na wambulula mbaka kunze mwa kae kuno wao wavimanya kua kadanganika. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Mbali waluko wamwenga viwaikunzanye na kumzunguluka kalamka na kubwela kuikae. Viivikile igolo yake yeye na Banaba waita Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Banaba wobwela muikae ya Antiokia uko Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulo na Banaba viwakomeleze kuligula Usenga Unogile uko Delibe na kupata wajalusona wengi wamtogole Kilisito. Amala wailumba hamwe kuita kae ya kae ya Lusitila na Ikonio na Antiyokia ya Pisidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawashwangiza wamtogole Kilisito wa kae izo, na kuwagela moyo ili wagangamale kwa kumtogola Kilisito. Wawalongela, “Cheye chose wanhu wochidununza chihawa ching'hali hachina kwingila muufaume wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Viwakomeleze kuwasagula wavele mchila bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito, wapula Mulungu na kufunga kuja Mulungu yawakimile. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Amala wabitila uko Pisidia na kuvika uko Pamfulia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Viwakomeleze kuligula uja usenga uko Peliga, wahumulukila uko Atalia, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />kulawa uko waita kwa ngalawa muibahali kubwela Antiokia ya Pisidia kuja wamtogole Kilisito wekigwa muumilizi wa unovu wa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya sang'hano ija vino sambi wakala waikomeleza. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Viwavikile uko Antiokia wawakema wanhu wose womtogola Kilisito weli uko na kuwalongela gaja Mulungu gayasang'hane hamwe nao, na vija viyawadahize wanhu wa isi zimwenga kumtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Nao Paulo na Banaba kwa chipindi chitali wakala hamwe nao uko waja wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mting'hanilo uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wanhu wamwenga wavika Antiokia kulawa Yudea, nao wasonga kuwafunda waja wanhu haweli Wayahudi wamtogole Kilisito kwa kulonga, “Hamdaha kuloholigwa kama hamwingile kumbi kama Musa viyachifundile.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Mbuli ino iwatenda Paulo na Banaba sekewaitogolele nao. Ivo wanhu wawasagula Paulo na Banaba hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wa Antiokia wamtogole Kilisito waite Yelusalemu kuwaona waja wasenga na wavele kwa mbuli iyo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Baho bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wawalaga, na wao viwakalile wobitila uko Foinike na Samalia wawalongela wanhu vija wanhu wa isi zimwenga viwamhindukile Mulungu. Mbuli izo ziweng'ha ndeng'helelo ng'hani wanhu wao wose.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Viwavikile uko Yelusalemu wabokeligwa na wanhu wamtogole Kilisito, na wasenga wa Mulungu na wavele, nao ivija wawalongela zija mbuli zose Mulungu yazisang'hane kubitila wao. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Mbali wanhu wamwenga wa chibumbila cha Mafalisayo wamtogole Kilisito wema na kulonga, “Yolondeka wanhu wa isi zimwenga wageligwe kumbi na kufundigwa mbuli ya kuigoga ndagizi za Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Baho waja wasenga wa Mulungu na wavele vilongozi watenda mting'hanilo hamwe ili kuilongelela mbuli ino. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Viwakalile wolongelela kwa chipindi chitali, Petulo kema na kulonga, “Mbwiga zangu, mweye movimanya kua baho haumwanduso Mulungu kakala na wende wa kunisagula niye mmwenu ili nipwililise Usenga Unogile kwa wanhu wa isi, ili wauhulike na kutogola. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Mulungu, iyo yaimanyile mioyo ya wanhu, kagangamiza kua kawatogola na kuweng'ha Muhe wake kama viyaching'ile cheye. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Habagule wowose mmwetu hebu mmwao na kawalekesela malozo gao kwavija wamtogola Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ivo, habali molema gaja Mulungu gayasang'hane kwa kuweng'ha mbahasha zija zizamile wanhu wao ija wavele wetu hebu cheye hachidaha kuipapa? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Sekeiwe ivo, ila chotogola kua, cheye kama wao ivija, choloholigwa kubitila unovu wa Mndewa Yesu Kilisito kama wao viwaloholigwa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Wanhu wose wakalile baho wanyamala hupi, kuno wowategeleza Banaba na Paulo viwakalile wolongelela mbuli za miujiza na miuzonza ija Mulungu yaisang'hane kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Viwakomeleze kulongelela, Yakobo kasonga kulonga, “Wayangu nhegelezeni! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni kasimulila vija Mulungu baho haumwanduso, viyawasang'hanile wanhu wa isi zimwenga, na kusagula wanhu wamwenga mmwao ili wawe wanhu wake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mbuli ino iilinga na mbuli za walagusi wa Mulungu, kama Mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalonga,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Mbuli zino zihamala nobwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na nozenga kaidi chija chibanda cha Daudi chigwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Nogazenga gaja mahame gake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kugatenda gagangamale kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Ili wanhu wamwenga wose wanihindukile nie Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">na wanhu haweli Wayahudi wose niwakemile wawe wangu.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Vino ivo vinilonga nie Mndewa, nisang'hane mbuli zino zimanyike kulawa umwaka.’”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobo kagendelela kulonga, “Kwaivo ulamuzi wangu uwo uno, Sekechiwagaze wanhu wa isi zimwenga waja wombwelela Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ivo, chiwandikile balua ya kuwalongela seke waje ndia ija ilongigwe mwiko kujigwa kwa kutambikiligwa na wananyang'iti wa milungu, wainege na luhadu, seke waje mnyama yoyose yabobotigwe na seke wang'we damu. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwa chipindi chitali, mbuli za Musa zikala ziliguligwa kwavija kulawa umwaka mafundo ga Musa gafundigwa mchila kae na Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi Mdizua da kuhumula.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balua kwa wamtogole Kilisito waja haweli Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Wasenga, wavele na bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito walamula kuwasagula wanhu wamwenga mmwao na kuwalagiza uko Antiokia hamwe na Paulo na Balisaba. Wamsagula Yuda ija ivija yakemigwe Balisaba, na Sila waja wose wakalile womanyika ng'hani mwa ndugu wamtogole Kilisito, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />na waweng'ha ino balua,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Cheye wasenga wa Mulungu na wavele, ndugu zenu, chowalamuseni mweye ndugu wa isi zimwenga mliuko kae ya Antiokia, isi ya Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Chihulika kua wanhu wamwenga kulawa kuno kumwetu wamwagazanyeni kwa mbuli zao, na kuwatendani mdumbe. Mbali watenda ivo bila cheye kuwalagiza kutenda ivo. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ivo, chose chilamula kuwasagula wanhu wamwenga na kuwalagiza kumwenu hamwe na mbwiga zenu wa wende Banaba na Paulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />waja waihonzile kwa mbuli ya zina da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kwaivo, chowalagiza kumwenu Yuda na Sila, wano wenyego wowafambulila gaja gachandikile. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Baho muhe wa Mulungu na cheye chitogola kua seke chiwageleke mbuli ndala kubita zija zilondeke mzimanye,<verse eid="ACT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />seke mje ndia itambikiligwe na milungu ya nyang'iti, seke mng'we damu, seke mje nyama ya mnyama yabobotigwe na muitiganye na mbuli za uluhadu. Motenda goya kama mwahainega na gago, hewela!”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Viwakomeleze kuwalaga, wanhu wao walawa Yelusalemu wahumulukia kuita kae ya Antiokia uko wawakema wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisito, waweng'ha ija balua. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Viwaisomile iyo balua Wanhu wao, mbuli ziliumo ziwagela moyo na wadeng'helela ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila, waja wakalile Walagusi wa Mulungu, walongelela nao ndugu kwa chipindi chitali kuno wowagela moyo na kuwagangamiza. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Viwakalile uko kwa chipindi chiguhi, Yuda na wamwenga wawalaga waja ndugu wa kae ya Antiokia na kuwapulila utindiwala, amala wabwela kwa waja wawalagize. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Mbali Sila kusigala. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbali Sila kusigala. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mayandiko gamwenga gabule msitali uno </char><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulo na Banaba hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wasigala uko Antiokia kwa chipindi, wakafunda na kuligula usenga wa Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Banaba woigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Vigabitile mazua chidodo, Paulo kamlongela Banaba, “Haya chibwele chikawalongele waja ndugu mchila kae chiligule usenga wa Mndewa, ili chiilolele vija viwagendelela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baho Banaba ivija kalonda yamsole Maluko. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Mbali Paulo kaona havinogile kumsola Maluko ija haumwanduso yawalekile kuja Pamfulia na kulema kuilumba muisang'hano yao. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Basi, halawilila uhasanyi mkulu kummwao, baho waigola. Banaba kamsola Maluko na wakwela ngalawa kuita Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Nayo Paulo kamsagula Sila, na baada ya ndugu wa hanhu haja kumwika muulolezi wa unovu wa Mndewa, wasegela. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Kabitila isi ya Silia na Kilikia kuno kowagela moyo mabumbila ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoseo koilongoza na Paulo na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Baho Paulo kavika kae ya Delibe na Lusitila, kuja kukala mjalusona imwe yokemigwa Timoteo. Mami yake kakala Myahudi yamtogole Kilisito na tati yake kakala Myunani. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoteo kakala munhu yolongeleligwa vinogile na wayage wamtogole Kilisito wa Lusitila na Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo kamlonda Timoteo waite hamwe muumwanza, kwaivo kamwingiza kumbi. Kasang'hana ivo kwa vija Wayahudi wose wakalile uko wavimanya kua tati yake Timoteo kakala Myunani. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Viwakalile wobita mja mzikae zija waweng'ha wanhu gaja malagizo galavigwe na wasenga na wavele kuja Yelusalemu, kuno wawalogela wagagoge. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ivo gaja mabumbila ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wagendelela kugangamala kumtogola Kilisito, na wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wongezeka chila zua.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kaona maloleso uko Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Wabitila hanhu ha Fulugia na Galatia kwa vija Muhe wa Mulungu hawatogolele kuligula usenga uko Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Viwavikile mzimhaka za Musia, wageza kwingila Mumkoa wa Bitunia, mbali Muhe wa Yesu hawatogolele. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ivo, wabita Musia waita dimwe kwa dimwe wahulumukila Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Chilo icho, Paulo kaona maloleso ya munhu imwe kulawa Makedonia kema haja na kumpula, “Loka, wize Makedonia uchitaze.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Kwaivo Paulo viyaonile maloleso gago, chiisasala hima kuita Makedonia, chikala chivimanya kua Mulungu kachikema chiwaligulile Usenga Unogile.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidia komtogola Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Chilawa Tiloa, chiita kwa ngalawa dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka chisiwa cha Samotileke, na igolo yake chivika kae ya Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Vichilawile uko, chiita mbaka Filipi, kae ng'hulu ya isi ya Makedonia, uja ukalile wolongozigwa na Walumi. Chikala muiisi iyo kwa mazua madodo. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Zua da kuhumula chilawa kunze haikae, chiita hamgwazo ya lwanda haja hachigesile kua iyo hanhu ha kufufugama. Chikala baho na kulongelela na wanachike wakalile hanhu baho.<verse eid="ACT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Baho wanhu mmwao waja wachitegeleze, ivija kakala mwanachike imwe yokemigwa Lidia mwenekae ya Suatila yomtogola Mulungu, iyo yakalile mgula vivalo va bei ng'hulu va zambalau. Mndewa kautanda moyo wake utogole mbuli zija ziyalongile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mama iyo hamwe na waukae yake viwabatizigwe kachigoneka muing'anda yake kalonga, “Kama mhaniona nie nomtogola Mndewa, izoni mkale muing'anda yangu.” Kachishwangiza chiite.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila wogeligwa mdigeleza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Zua dimwe vichiitile hanhu hahaja hakufugamila, chiiting'hanila na biti imwe mtumwa yakalile yambule chinyamkela wa kulagula. Kubitila biti iyo wakulu wake wakala woipatila sente nyingi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Baho, iyo biti kamuwinza Paulo na cheye ivija kuno yoguta nyangi na yolonga, “Wano wanhu ni wasenga wa Mulungu mkulu ng'hani. Wowalongeleni vija vumdaha kuloholigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Biti iyo kakala yotenda ivo kwa mazua mengi, mbali zua dimwe Paulo kehiligwa, kamhindukila na kumlongela iyo chinyamkela, “Nokulakila kwa nzina da Yesu Kilisito, mlawe biti ino!” Bahaja iyo chinyamkela kamlawa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Waja wazenzi wa ija biti viwaonile tamanilo jao da kupata sente dahabule, wawagoga Paulo na Sila, wawagala hazelu, haulongozi ha wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wawalongelezela kwa walamuzi kwa kulonga, “Wanhu wano ni Wayahudi na wogala dwagi muikae yetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wofunda mazoela gaja kumwetu cheye Walumi hachilondeka kuzitogola hebu kuziwinza.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Bumbila da wanhu dikalile haja diilumba na kuwatoa Paulo na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Baho waja walamuzi walamula wavuligwe vivalo vao na walibuligwe mbalati. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Viwamalile kuwalibula ng'hani wageligwa mdigeleza, na kumlagiza mkulu wa geleza kuweka muuwimilizi mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Viyabokele malagizo gago, iyo mkulu wa geleza kawegela mgati ng'hani mwa dija geleza na kuwafunga magulu kwa vihande va mbao.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Chilo chikulu Paulo na Sila wakala wopula na kwimba nyila za kumtogola Mulungu, kuno wafungwa wamwenga wakala wotegeleza.<verse eid="ACT 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bahaja halawila gudemo kulu da isi mbaka iitigisa misimikilo ya geleza. Mala milwivi yose ivuguka na minyololo iwalekesa wafungigwa wose. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mwimilizi wa geleza viyalamuke na kuona milwivi ya geleza ivuguligwa, kagesa kua wafungwa wose wakala wakimbila, na ivo kadisomola panga jake na kalonda kuikoma.<verse eid="ACT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Mbali Paulo kaguta kwa dizi kulu kalonga, “Seke uikome mwenyego cheye chose chabaha!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Mmilizi mkulu wa geleza kumkema munhu yagale lumuli, kengila mgati ya geleza na kuibwanha hamagulu ga Paulo na Sila kuno kogudema kwa kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Amala kawalava kunze na kawauza, “Mweye wakulu, nhendeze mhate kuloholigwa?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Wao wamwidika, “Mtogola Mndewa Yesu gweye hamwe na wanhu wose wa ng'anda yako baho moloholigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Baho, wamligulila usenga wa Mndewa yeye na wose weli mng'anda yake. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Chilo ichija ija mmilizi kawasola kawasunha vilonda vao, amala iyo na wanhu wose wakalile mng'anda yake wa bahaja wabatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Labaho wawasola Paulo na Sila mbaka ukae yake, na kaweng'ha ndia. Iyo na wose wakalile mng'anda yake wadeng'helela sana kwavija sambi wamtogola Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Igolo yake imitondo, walamuzi wawalagiza wakulu wa wamilizi kwa mmilizi mkulu wa geleza walonga, “Walekeseleni wanhu wao waite.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ija mwimilizi mkulu wa geleza kamlongela Paulo, “Walamuzi wagala usenga ili mlekesegwe. Ivo, sambi modaha kulawa na kuita kwa utindiwala.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Paulo kamwidika, “Wachilibula mbalati hazelu hata kama chibanange chinhu na cheye cha Walumi, kaidi wachigela mdigeleza na sambi wonda kuchilekesela kwa chifiso, haidahika! Wolondeka wao wenyego weze hano wachilave mdigeleza.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Waja wakulu wa wamilizi wabwela wawalongela walamuzi mbuli iyo, nao viwahulike kua Paulo na Sila wakala wenekae wa Loma, wadumba. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Baho waita kuwapula ili wasamehigwe, na viwakomeleze kuwalava mdigeleza wawalongela wasegele kulawa muikae ija. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paulo na Sila walawa mdigeleza, waita ukae kwa Lidia. Uko waiting'hanila na ndugu wamtogole Kilisito wawagela moyo, amala wasegela.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yolawila ndwagi uko Sesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulo na Sila waita mwanza wabitila kae ya Amfipoli na Apolonia, wavika kuikae ya Sesalonike kuli na ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi.<verse eid="ACT 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulo kailumba nawo kama viikalile mazoela gake, kalonga nao kwa Mazua madatu ga kuhumula, kuno yotumila Mayandiko ga Mulungu <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />na kulonda kulagusa kua ilondeka Kilisito yadununzigwe yafe na kuzilibuka. Paulo kawalongela, “Yesu inimligula usenga wake iyo Kilisito.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wayahudi wamwenga mmwao watogola na kuilumba na Paulo na Sila na ivija hakala na Wayunani wengi wamtogole Mulungu hamwe na wanachike wengi weli na nhogolwa muiisi iyo nao wailumba nao.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Mbali Wayahudi waona maya, wawagoneka wanhu wehile kulawa mdigulilo wakunzanya chibumbila cha kugala ndwagi mzikae zose. Waita waivamila ng'anda ya Yasoni kuno watumanila kuwapata umo Paulo na Sila ili wawagale ha wanhu.<verse eid="ACT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Mbali umo hawawapatile na ivo wawagoga na kuwagala msobemsobe mbaka kwa wakulu wa kae, waguta nyangi walonga, “Wanhu wano wakala wogala ndwagi ng'hulu mziisi zimwenga zose na vino sambi wa hano muikae <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />na Yasoni kawalalika kuing'anda yake. Wose wozilema ndagizi ya Kaisali kuno wolonga kua, ‘Hana mfaume imwenga yokemigwa Yesu.’” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kwa mbuli izo wawatenda wakulu wa kae na wanhu wose wahulike ivo wagwa chigudemo. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Wakulu wao wawatenda Yasoni na wayage walihe sente zilondeke, amala wawaleka wasegele.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila uko Beloya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ichilo, waja ndugu wamtogole Yesu wawashwangiza Paulo na Sila waite Beloya. Viwavikile uko, waita Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wanhu wa uko wakala wanhu wolonda kufundigwa kubita wanhu waja wa Sesalonike. Waubokela kwa ndeng'helelo usenga uja walongeligwe na Paulo. Chila zua wagasoma na kufambula Mayandiko ili kuvimanya kua gayalonga Paulo kua kweli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wayahudi wengi watogola hamwe na wanachike na walume weli na nhogolwa wa Kiyunani. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Mbali Wayahudi weli Sesalonike viwahulike Paulo ivija koligula usenga wa Mulungu uko Beloya, waita uko ili kuwashwangiza wanhu na kuwatenda wagale ndwagi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Bahaja waja wamtogole Kilisito wamgala Paulo mhwani, mbali Sila na Timoteo wasigala bahaja Beloya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Waja wanhu wamgalile Paulo waita hamwe nayo mbaka kae ya Asene, amala wamleka wabwela na malagizo kulawa kwa Paulo kua Sila na Timoteo wamuwinze hima kama vonda idahike.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolongelela na wanhu uko Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulo viyakalile kowabeta Sila na Timoteo uko Asene, moyo wake uhiligwa ng'hani viyaonile kae ija imema milungu ya nyang'iti.<verse eid="ACT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Viyaitile Kuing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kalongelela na Wayahudi na Wayunani waja wamtogole Mulungu. Chila zua kakala yolongelela na wanhu hazelu na chila yaiting'hanile nayo.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wamwenga waja wawinzile nzewele ya Epikulo na Stoiki wamlemela Paulo. Wamwenga walonga, “Ino mlopo kolonda kulonga choni?” Kwa vija Paulo kakala koligula mbuli ya Yesu na kwa mbuli ya uzilibuko, wanhu wamwenga walonga, “Viioneka koligula kwa mbuli ya milungu ya nyambenyambe.” <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Baho wamsola Paulo, wamgala mbaka kumting'hanilo uko hanu hakuitin'na Aleopago, walonga, “Cholonda kuimanya mbuli ino ya sambi ija ukalile koilongelela. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Manake vinhu vimwenga vichihulike mmagutwi getu vioneka kama vakukanganya. Cholonda kuvimanya kua mbuli zino manake choni.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Wanhu wa Asene na nyambenyambe wa uko wakala wotumila chipindi chikulu, kuisimulila na kutegeleza mbuli za sambi.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Baho, Paulo kema haulongozi ha balaza da Aleopago kalonga, “Wanhu wa Asene, noona kua mweye kwa vovose ni wanhu moifugamila ng'hani milungu yenu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Vinikalile nobita uko na uko kuno nowalola milungu yenu ya nyang'iti muifugamila, ivija niona chilemela chimwe chandikigwe, ‘Kwa Mulungu ija hamanyike.’ Baho iyo yumumfugamila bila kummanya, iyonilonda nimligulileni. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mulungu yailumbile isi na vose viliumo, iyo Mndewa wa ulanga na isi, iyo hakala mzing'anda za Mulungu zizengigwe na wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Hebu halonda kutazigwa na munhu kama vija kolonda chinhu chochose chija kulawa kumwao, manake iyo mwenyego iyo yoweng'ha wanhu ugima na mhumuzi na kuweng'ha chila chinhu.<verse eid="ACT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kulawa kumwake kalumba wanhu wa isi zose weli muisi. Kalamula chipindi chilihi na halihi haja honda yaweke ili wakale. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Mulungu kasang'hana ivo ili wanhu wamzambwile, na wamuone hata kwa kubabasababasa. Mbali hata ivo, Mulungu heli hatali na chila imwe mmwetu. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Kama munhu imwe viyalongile, ‘Kubitila iyo cheye chokala, chogenda na kuwa na ugima,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Ni kama wandika nongezi wenu wamwenga viwolonga, ‘Cheye iyo wanage.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Yahawa ivo, kama cheye ni wana wa Mulungu, haifaya kumtonga Mulungu kua kama nyang'iti ya zahabu hebu madini ga sente hebu mabwe gaja gasongoligwe kwa ugalu wa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mulungu kasang'hana kama vija haona chipindi chija wanhu viwakalile hawammanyile Mulungu wa kweli. Mbali sambi, kowalongela wanhu wose wa chila hanhu wagalonge malonzo gao na kugaleka, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwa vija kakomeleza kwika zua da kulamula isi kama viilondigwa kubitila Munhu imwe ija yamsagule. Mulungu kawagangamizila wose mbuli ino kwa kumzilibula Munhu iyo!”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Viwamhulike Paulo kolonga kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka, wamwenga wao waseka, mbali wamwenga walonga, “Cholonda kukuhulika kaidi kwambuli ino!”<verse eid="ACT 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Baho Paulo kawaleka, kalawa mja mchitala. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Mbali wanhu wamwenga wailumba nayo, na kumtogola Kilisito. Mmwao wakala Dionisio wa luhelengo lwa Aleopago na mwanachike imwe yokemigwa Damali na wamwenga wao.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Vigamalile gago, Paulo kalawa kae ya Asene kaita Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Uko Kolinto kamvika Myahudi imwe yokemigwa Akila, mleligwa wa Ponto. Akila hamwe na mwehe wake yokemigwa Pilisikila, wabwela kulawa Italia mmazua gao kwa vija Kaisali Klaudio kakala yalagize Wayahudi wose wasegele kae ya Loma. Paulo kaita kuwatembelela, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na kwa vija wao wakala wanhu wa kusona mahema kama iyo Paulo, baho Paulo kakala nao na kusona mahema hamwe nao. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Chila Zua da kuhumula Paulo kakala yolongelela nao Wayahudi na Wayunani Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi ili wamtogole Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoteo viwavikile Makedonia, Paulo kailava chipindi chake chose kwa mbuli ya kuwaligulila Wayahudi na kuwalagusila kua Yesu iyo Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Mbali viwalemile na kumliga, kakung'husa timbwisi da vivalo vake kulagusa kua, “Mwahaga, iyo mbuli yenu wenyego, niye silaumigwa kwambuli iyo. Na kulawa vino sambi na kugendelela nowawinza wanhu waja haweli Wayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ivo, kalawa baho kaita na kakala muing'anda ya munhu imwe yokemigwa Tito Yusto yomfugamila Mulungu. Ng'anda yake ikalabehi na ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo, mkulu wa iyo ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, kamtogola Mndewa iyo hamwe na mbwiga zake wose, wanhu wengi Wakolinto wautegeleza usenga huo, watogola na kubatizigwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Zua dimwe ichilo, Mndewa kamlongela Paulo mgamaloleso, “Sekeudumbe, gendelela kuligula tu na sekeuleke, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />manake niye na hamwe na gweye. Habule munhu yonda yageze kukutoa maana hano muikae hana wanhu wengi weli ubanzi wangu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Baho, Paulo kakala uko kuno yofunda usenga wa Mulungu kwa chipindi cha mlao umwe na nusu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mbali Galio viyakalile mkulu wa isi ya Akaya, Wayahudi wamvamila Paulo na kumgala mchitala, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />walonga, “Munhu ino kowaswangiza wanhu wamfugamile Mulungu bila kuwinza ndagizi viilonda!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulo viyakalile yang'hali hanalonga, Galio kawalongela Wayahudi, “Tegelezeni mweye Wayahudi, kama kweli mbuli ino yahawile yakumtoa munhu hebu ya ubananzi nihawategelezeni. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Mbali kwavija kwambuli ya ulonzi na mazina hebu ndagizi zenu lamuleni wenyego. Niye silonda kuwa mlamuzi wa mbuli izo!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Baho kawawinga kulawa mchitala.<verse eid="ACT 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Nao wose wamgela mmakono Sosetene ija chilongozi wa ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, na wamtoa haulongozi wa chitala. Mbali Galio hatongile mbuli iyo hata chidodo.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kobwela kaidi uko Antiokia ya Silia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulo viyakalile yang'hali uko Kolinto na waja ndugu kwa mazua mengi. Amala kawalaga na kakwela ngalawa kaita uko Silia hamwe na Pilisikila na Akila. Paulo viwavikile uko Kenikelea kabeya mvili zake kwa vija kakala kakomeleza chiyailalike kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Viwavikile Efeso Paulo kawaleka Pilisikila na Akila, nayo kaita Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kulongelela mbuli na Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Wanhu wampula yakale nao kwa chipindi chitali ng'hani, mbali hatogole. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Baho viyakalile yosegela kalonga, “Mulungu yahalonda nobwela kumwenu kaidi.” Kasegela baho Efeso kwa ngalawa.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ngalawa ivika Kaisalea, nayo Paulo kaita Yelusalemu kuwalamusa bumbila da wanhu wamtogole Kilisito, amala kaita Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Kakala uko kwa mazua madodo, labaho kagendelela na mwanza wake kwa kubitila ubanzi wa Galatia na Flugia na kawagela moyo wajalusona wose.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo koligula usenga wa Mulungu uko Efeso na Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Chipindi icho hakala na Myahudi imwe yokemigwa Apolo, mleligwa wa Alekisandilia, kavika Efeso. Iyo kakala munhu yeli na ugalu wa kulonga na yeli na udaho mkulu wa Mayandiko ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Kakala yafundigwe mbuli ya iyo nzila ya Mndewa, nayo kakala yoiyoha mmoyo kakala yofunda goya mbuli za Yesu hata kama kakala yovimanya ubatizo wa Yohana uiyeka. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apolo kasonga kufunda bila kudumba Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, Pilisikila na Akila viwamhulike wamsola na waita nayo kumwao na kumuongezela vinhu vimwenga vija havimanyile kwa nzila ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Amala Apolo viyaitile uko Akaya, waja wanhu wamtogole Kilisito wamgela moyo kwa kuwandikila wajalusona wa kuja Akaya ili wambokele. Viyavikile uko kawataza ng'hani waja kwa unovu wa Mulungu wamtogola Kilisito, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Manake kakala yoibishila na Wayahudi kwa ugalu haulongozi wa wanhu kwa kugangamiza kubitila Mayandiko ga Mulungu kua Yesu ni Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koligula uko Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo viyakalile uko Kolinto, Paulo kaita mwanza kabitila hanhu heli na vigongo mbaka kavika Efeso kuja kuyawavikile waluko wamwenga, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />na kawauza, “Ivo, mubokela Muhe wa Mulungu vumumtogole Yesu?” Nao wamwidika, “Habule! Mosi, hachina hulika kama hana Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Nayo kalonga, “Ivo, mbokela ubatizo wa vilihi?” Wamwidika,“Ubatizo wa Yohana.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulo kalonga,“Ubatizo wa Yohana ukala wa kulagusa wanhu kua wagalonga malozo gao na kugaleka. Yohana kawalongela wanhu wamtogole ija yakalile yonda kwiza badili yake, manake Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Viwamalile kugahulika gago,wabatizigwa kwa nzina da Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Baho Paulo kawekila makono na Muhe wa Mulungu uwahulumukila, nao wasonga kulonga ulonzi umwenga na kuligula usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Baho wanhu wose wakala kama walume kumi na waidi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kwa chipindi cha miezi midatu Paulo kakala koita Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi wakala wolongelelanao na kuwapula weze muufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Mbali wanhu wamwenga wakala wobela, ivo walema kutogola na wasonga kulongelela vihile kwa mbuli ya iyo nzila ya Mndewa Yesu mdimbumbila kulu da wanhu. Baho, Paulo kaleka kulonga nao na kawasola waja waluko wake kuno kakala yolonga nao chila zua muing'anda ya kusomela ya Tulano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Kagendelela kutenda ivo kwa milao midi mbaka wenekae wose wa isi ya Asia, Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi wauhulika usenga wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wabwanga wa Sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mulungu kasang'hana miujiza mingi kubitila Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Wanhu wakala wosola vitambala na vivalo vimwenga kwa sang'hano zija Paulo yakalile kavitumila, wazigala kwa watamu nao wahonyigwa vitamu vao, na waja wakalile wambula vinyamkela nao walekesigwa na vinyamkela ivo. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayahudi wamwenga wahunga vinyamkela waita uko na uko kuno wogeza kutumila zina da Mndewa Yesu kwa waja wakalile wambule vinyamkela. Wakala wolonga, “Nolagiza kwa zina da Yesu ija Paulo yakalile yomligula.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Hakala na wabwanga saba wa Sikewa ija mkulu wa walava nhambiko wa Kiyahudi, nao wakala wotenda ivo.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Zua dimwe chinyamkela kawedika, “Yesu nommanya na Paulo nommanya, mweye mwa china nani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Labaho ija munhu yambule chinyamkela kawavamila na kuwatoa na kuwahuma kwa ludabwa. Nao wabwanga wa Sikewa wakimbila na kulawa kunze muing'anda bila chivalo. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Chila munhu uko Efeso, yeli Myahudi hebu sio Myahudi kahulika mbuli iyo. Baho wose wadumba ng'hani, wading'ha nhogolwa zina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wamtogole Kilisito wengi walawila hazelu na kuzilonga hazelu sang'hano zao zihile ziwatendile. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wamwenga wakalile wosang'hana uhawi, wavikunzanya vitabu na kuvisoma moto haulongozi ha wanhu. Wapeta hisabu ya bei ya vitabu ivo va uhawi, waona ivika vihande hamsini elufu va madini ga sente. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Kwaivo, usenga wa Mndewa ugendelela kwenela na kua na udaho ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wotenda ndwagi uko Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Vizibitile mbuli izo, Paulo kaita Yelusalemu kwa kubitila Makedonia na Akaya. Kalonga, “Yahavika uko ivija nolondeka kuita Lumi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Baho, kawalagiza watazi wake waidi, Timoteo na Elasto,wamulongolele waite Makedonia kwa chipindi chiguhi nayo kasigala uko Asia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mchipindi icho icho chilawilile ndwagi ng'hulu uko Efeso kwa mbuli ya iyo nzila ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Hakala na msang'hanaji wa vinhu va shaba yokemigwa Demetilio, ija yakalile yosang'hana mlungu wa nyang'iti wa chike yokemigwa Alitemi. Sang'hano iyo iwapatila watazi wake sente nyingi zongezeke. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetilio kawakunzanya hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wakalile na sang'hano kama iyo, kawalongela, “Mweye wabwanga movimanya kua uzenzi wenu wolawila kwa sang'hano ino. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Kwaivo, modaha kuhulika na kuionela wenyego kwa meso genu mbuli za Paulo ziyotenda, sio hano Efeso haiyeka, mbali ivija mbaka uko Asia yose. Iyo kawaswangiza na kuwatenda wanhu watogole kua milungu ija isang'hanigwe na wanhu si milungu bule. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ivo, hana bung'hukila ya sang'hano yetu kukemigwa kwa zina dihile. Sio ivo tu, mbali mbuli iyo yodaha kuitenda ng'anda ya mulungu Alitemi kua si chinhu chili na mana. Viioneka, nhogolwa za Atemi yofugamiligwa Asia na isi yose, zomala.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Viwahulike gago, wehiligwa ng'hani na wasonga kuguta nyangi,“Alitemi mulungu nyang'iti wa Waefeso ni mkulu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Baho kae yose ikala na ndwagi. Wamgoga Gayo na Alisitaliko, wenekae wa Makedonia waja wayage wakalile muumwanza umwe na Paulo, wakimbila nao mbaka muuhelengo wa kuvinila. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo mwenyego kalonda kuita kuja kudibumbila da wanhu, mbali waja wamtogole Yesu wamgoma. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Wakulu wamwenga wa isi ya Asia, waja wakalile mbwiga zake, wamgalila Paulo usenga kuno wompula sekeyaite muluhengo la kuvinila.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Chipindi icho, chila munhu kakala yolila kwa dizi kulu, wamwenga wolonga dino na wamwenga dija, mbaka hata uja mting'hanilo upwililika. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wayahudi wamgala Alekizanda haulongozi ha wanhu, na wanhu wamwenga mja mdibumbila wasonga kulonga nayo, baho nayo Alekizanda kawahungila mkono yolonda kuigombela. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Mbali viwamanyile kua iyo Myahudi, wose hamwe waguta nyangi kwa masaa maidi walonga,“Altemi wa Waefeso ni mkulu!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kilongozi wa kae ija kadaha kawatenda wanyamale, kawalongela, “Wenekae wa Efeso chila munhu kovimanya kua kae ino ya Efeso ni mmilizi wa ng'anda ya mulungu Alitemi na mmilizi wa ija mulungu wa nyang'iti yagwile hasi kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Habule munhu yodaha kubela mbuli izo. Nvo, nyamaleni hupi sekemlopole kusang'hana chochose bila kutonga goya. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwagala wano wanhu hano mbali hawebile chinhu chochose muing'anda ya mulungu hebu hawamligile mulungu wetu wa chike.<verse eid="ACT 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Ivo, kama Demetilio na wasang'hanaji wayage wana mbuli yao kwa wanhu wano, vabaho vitala na wakulu wa isi, vodahika kuzilongelela mbuli zao uko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Kama mwahawa na mbuli zimwenga zigaleni mchitala cha ndagizi.<verse eid="ACT 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Manake chihagaligwe mchitala kwa mbuli ya ndwagi za lelo chihapotigwe kuigombela kwavija ndwagi zino zabule mana yoyose.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kawalongela wanhu wose weli mu mting'hanilo wasegele.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koita kaidi uko Makedonia na Uyunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ija ndwagi ya kuja Efeso viimalile, Paulo kawakema hamwe waja wamtogole Kilisito na kawagela moyo. Amala kawalaga kaita mwanza wa Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kabita muiisi ija kuno kowagela moyo kwa mbuli nyingi. Labaho kavika Uyunani, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />kuyakalile kwa miezi midatu. Viyakalile koitanda kuita Silia, baho kavimanya kua Wayunani wamkalila chigwena chihile, ivo kalamula kubwela kwa kubitila Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatilo, mwana wa Pilo kulawa Beloya, kailongoza nayo. Ivija kailongoza na Alistaliko na Sekundo kulawa Sesalonike, na Gayo kulawa Delibe na Timoteo na Tukiko na Tilofimo wa Mkoa wa Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Hao wachilongolela na kuchibeta kuja Tiloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Vichikomeleze lusona lwa migate ija haigeligwe mela, chikwela meli kulawa Filipi, vichikalile mazua matano chiwavika kuja Tiloa. Uko chikala kwa chipindi cha juma dimwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mchikomelezo Paulo kaita uko Tiloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Vidivikile zua da mosi da juma, chiiting'hanila kuja ndia ya Mndewa hamwe. Kwa vija Paulo kakala kaitanda kusegela igolo yake, kawaligulila wanhu na kugendelela kulonga nao mbaka chilo chikulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Muing'anda ija ichikalile uko kudigolofa, kukala na vimuli vingi vokwaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Chipindi Paulo viyakalile yogendelela kuligula, mbwanga imwe yokemigwa Yutiko kakala mdidilisha. Yutiko kakala yosonga kukukila mbaka kawasa utulo, na kagwa hasi kulawa kuja kugolofa ya nhatu. Wamdondola kuno yafile.<verse eid="ACT 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Mbali Paulo kahulumuka hasi, kainamila kamuhagata na kulonga, “Sekemgudeme manake yang'hali mgima.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Amala Paulo kakwela kaidi kudigolofa, kasola ndia kaja. Kagendelela kulonga nao kwa chipindi chitali mbaka imitondo, amala kasegela. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Wanhu wamsola ija mbwana mbaka ukae yeli mgima, wakala na utindiwala ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolawa Tiloa kuita Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Cheye chikwela meli chilongola kuita Aso kuja chahamsolile Paulo. Ivo viyachilongele kusang'hana, kwavija kalonda kuvika uko kwa kugenda kwa magulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Baho, kachivika uko Aso, chimkweza muimeli chiita Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kulawa uko chiita mwanza mbaka igolo yake chivika uko Chio. Zua da kaidi, chivika Samo na igolo yake chivika Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo kakala kaitanda kugendelela na mwanza uwo kwa meli bila kubitila Efeso ili yalopole kuvika uko Asia. Baho kakala konda kuvika Yelusalemu hima kwa mbuli ya lusona lwa Pentekoste kama ihadahike.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kowalaga wavele wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kulawa Mileto Paulo kalagiza usenga kwa wavele wa Efeso ili waiting'hanile. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Viwaiting'hanile kawalongela, “Movimanya vija vinikalile na mweye mazua gose kulawa zua dija da mosi vinivikile Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Movimanya vija vinimsang'hanile Mndewa bila kuigoda, kwa mahozi na mbuli ndala zinipatile kwa mbuli ya vigwena va Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Movimanya kua sidumbile mbe kuwaligulila hazelu na mzing'anda zenu na kuwafunda chochose chija chihamtazeni. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Niwalongeni mose Wayahudi, ivija na wanhu wa isi, kua mumhindukile Mulungu na kumtogola Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Sambi tegelezeni, niye nihamtegeleza Muhe wa Mulungu, noita Yelusalemu bila kuvimanya gaja gonda ganipate uko.<verse eid="ACT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Chinimanya niye tu ni kua Muhe wa Mulungu konigangamizila kua vifungo na madununzo vonibeta muichila kae. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Mbali niye siuona ugima wangu kua chinhu chifaya ng'hani, ila chinilonda nikukomeleza sang'hano yaning'ile Mndewa Yesu, yani sang'hano ya kuligula Usenga Unogile na unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nibita mmwenu mose kuno noligula ufaume wa Mulungu. Mbali sambi, novimanya kua habule hata imwe mmwenu yonda yanione kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ivo, lelo nowagangamizileni kua kama yahaga imwe mmwenu, niye nabule dakulaumigwa jojose, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />manake niwalongeleni chila chinhu chija Mulungu chiyalonda mweye mchimanye. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Itiganyeni wenyego, hamwe na wanhu wose mwing'higwe na Mulungu, waja Muhe wa Mulungu kamwikeni mweye muwe walolezi wao. Diloleni goya bumbila da wamtogole Mulungu dija yadipatile kwa damu ya Mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Novimanya goya ng'hani kua niye nihasegela, wafunda uvizi weli kama umbwa mwitu wakali wowavamileni, na walibule bazi kwa bumbila ijo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hata kulawa mmwenu wolawila wanhu waja wolonga mbuli za uvwizi ili kuwagiza waja wamtogole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Kwaivo, ikimilileni na sekemuisemwe kua kwa chipindi cha milao midatu, misi na chilo silegele kumkomhokela chila imwe mmwenu kwa mahozi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Vino sambi, noweka mweye muuwimilizi wa Mulungu na usenga wa unovu wake uja uwadahiza kuwagangamiza mwenye na kuweng'ha ganogile gaja Mulungu koweng'ha wanhu wake wose. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Niye silondile hata mala lumwe mbuli ya sente, hebu zahabu hebu chivalo cha munhu yoyose. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mweye wenyego movimanya kua nisang'hana sang'hano kwa makono gangu mwenyego ili kuipatila vinhu vangu na va wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mwagaja gose ganisang'hane nikala nowalagusila, cholondeka kusang'hana kwa kuiyoha, ili kuwataza weli na uzidilwa. Chihaleka kuisemwa mbuli ya Mndewa wetu Yesu mwenyego viyalonga, ‘Kamweda ng'hani yolava kubita yobokela.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulo viyakomeleze kugalonga gago na waja wose wafugama mavindi, Paulo kampula Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wose wakala wolila, na kumlaga Paulo kwa kumhagatila. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Mbuli iwagelile ng'hani giogio, ukala uja usenga yalongile kua, hawamuona kaidi. Baho wamgala mbaka muingalawa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koita Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Vichikomeleze kuilaga kwa giogio, chikwela meli kuita dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka kae ya Kosi. Igolo yake chivika uko Lode na kulawa uko chiita Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Uko, chivika meli ikalile yoita uko Foinike, baho chikwela na chisonga mwanza.<verse eid="ACT 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Vichivikile hanhu haja hachionile chisiwa cha Kipulo, baho chibitila ubanzi wake wa hasi chiita isi ya Silia. Chima mhwani ya Tilo haja mbahasha zilondigwa kubakuligwa kulawa muimeli. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Uko chiwavika waluko na chikala hamwe nao kwa chipindi cha juma dibwe. Waluko wao wakala wolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, na kumlongela Paulo sekeyaite Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Mbali chipindi chetu vichimalile chisegela. Waluko wao wose hamwe na wanachike na wana wao wachigala mbaka hanze ya kae. Vichivikile mhwani, chose chifugama mavindi chipula. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Amala chiilaga na cheye chikwela meli, na wao wabwela kumwao.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Cheye chigendelea na mwanza wetu kulawa Tilo mbaka chivika Tolemai kwa meli, kuja chiwalamusa ndugu zetu wamtogole Kilisito na kukala nao zua dimwe.<verse eid="ACT 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Igolo yake chisegela na chiita kae ya Kaisalea. Uko chiita ukae kwa Filipo ija yakalile mligula usenga wa Mulungu. Iyo, kakala imwe mwa waja saba wasaguligwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Filipo kakala na mabiti wane mhambe waja wakalile wolava ulagusi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Vichikalile uko kwa mazua madodo, mlagusi imwe wa Mulungu yokemigwa Agabo kavika kulawa Uyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Viavikile kasola msipi wa Paulo, kagafunga makono na magulu gake kalonga, “Muhe wa Mulungu kalonga vino, ‘Vino ivo Wayahudi wa Yelusalemu vonda wamfunge ija yeli na msipi uno na kuwagala kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi.’”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Vichihulike gago, cheye na waja wanhu wamwenga chimpula ng'hani Paulo sekeyaite Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Mbali iyo kedika, “Habali molila na kunibena moyo? Niye nitogola kufungigwa hebu kudanganika uko Yelusalemu kwa mbuli ya zina da Mndewa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Vichipotigwe kumswangiza chinyamala na chilonga, “Diyalonda Mndewa ditendeke.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Vichikalile haja kwa chipindi chidodo, amala chifunga mbahasha zetu na chigendelela na mwanza wetu mbaka uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Waja waluko wamwenga kulawa Kaisalia waita hamwe na cheye, wachigala ha Mnasoni ija chiitile kukala nayo kwa chipindi chidodo, Mnasoni kakala mwenekae ya Kipulo na ivija kakala mwaluko kwa mazua mengi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komtembelela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Vichivikile Yelusalemu, ndugu wamtogole Kilisito wachibokela goya ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Igolo yake Paulo hamwe na cheye wamwenga wose chiita kumuona Yakobo na wavele wose wa bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito haja hawakalile. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Viwawalamuse, Paulo kaweng'ha vinogile usenga wose kwa mbuli yose ija Mulungu yakalile kaisang'hana mwa wanhu wose waja haweli Wayahudi kubitila utumigwa wake Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Viwahulike mbuli izo, wamwing'ha Mulungu nhogolwa. Amala wamlongela Paulo, “Ndugu, sambi koona kua hanamaelufu ga Wayahudi waja vino sambi wamtogola Kilisito na wose wao woitegeleza goya ndagizi za Musa.<verse eid="ACT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Mbali walongeligwa kua kukala kowafunda Wayahudi wose wakalile mwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga kua sekewaitogole ndagizi ya Musa, na sekewawengize kumbi wana wao wala kuwinza mazoela ga Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Sambi chitendeze? Kweli wapata usenga kua kwiza hano Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ivo tenda kama vichikulongela. Hano china wanhu wane weka malaliko ga kumlavila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ilumbe na wanhu wao kwa kuliha malaliko gao ga wekile kwa Mulungu na kulava nhosa zilondeka amala wabeigwe mvili zao. Baho wanhu wose wovimanya kua zija mbuli zose ziwalongeligwe kwambuli yako gauvwizi na kua gweye kuzigoga ndagizi za Musa.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Mbali kwa mbuli ya wanhu haweli Wayahudi, chimala kuwagalila balua kuno chiwalongela mbuli zichilamule, Seke waja chochose chitambikiligwe milungu ya uvwizi, seke wang'we damu, na seke waje nyama ya mnyama yabotigwe na wainege na uluhadu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ivo, igolo yake Paulo kawasola waja wanhu na waika kwa kutogoligwa kama vigalonda mazoela ga nhambiko. Amala kengila Muing'anda ya Mulungu na kuwalongela mazua gonda wakale baho na nhosa yondailavigwe kwa chila munhu mmwao.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Mbali mazua gago saba vigawile behi kumala, Wayahudi wamwenga wakalile wolawa mumkoa wa Asia wamwona Paulo Muing'anda ya Mulungu. Wawaswangiza wanhu wakalile baho nao wamgoga Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Waguta nyangi walonga, “Mweye Waizilaeli, chitazeni! Ino iyo ija munhu yofunda wanhu chila hanhu, kwambuli ya wanhu wetu na kuilema ndagizi za Musa na ng'anda ino ya Mulungu. Sambi kawengiza wanhu wamwenga haweli Wayahudi na kuhatenda hanhu hano seke hatogoligwe na Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Wadilonga dino, kwa vija wakala wamuonile Tilofimo ija mwenekae wa Efeso, yeli muikae hamwe na Paulo, na wagesa kua Paulo kakala yamwingize Muing'anda ya Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kae yose yenela ndwagi, wanhu weza kulawa chila ubanzi na wamgela mmakono Paulo, wambulula na kumlawa kunze ng'anda ya Mulungu. Amala milwivi mikulu ya ng'anda ya Mulungu ihindigwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Bumbila dija da wanhu vidikalile dolonda kumkoma Paulo, mbali baho usenga umvikila mkulu wa wamilizi wa Kiloma kua Yelusalemu yose imema ndwagi ng'hulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Bahaja iyo mkulu wa wamilizi kawasola wamilizi na vilongozi wa wamilizi na kukimbilila mzindwagi zija. Nao viwamonile ija mkulu wa wamilizi hamwe na wamilizi wake, waleka kumtoa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu wa wamilizi kamuwinza Paulo, kamgela mmakono na kulamula yafungigwe minyololo midi. Amala kauza, “Munhu ino nani na katenda choni?”<verse eid="ACT 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wanhu wamwenga mdibumbila dija da wanhu wakala woguta nyangi, wano wolonga dino na wamwenga wolonga dija. Mmilizi mkulu kapotigwa kuvimanya kwambuli ya nyangi zija, ivo kalagiza Paulo yagaligwe mng'anda ya geleza. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulo viyavikile muingazi ya kwingilila muing'hambi ya jeshi, wamilizi walamula kumpapa uchanha kwa vija hakala na ndwagi za dija bumbila da wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwa vija dija bumbila kulu da wanhu dikala domuwinza kuno doguta nyangi dolonga, “Yakomigwe!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Viwakalile womwingiza muingome ya wamilizi, Paulo viyamonile mkulu wa wamilizi kalonga, “Ivo, nodaha kukulongela chinhu?” Naija mkulu wa wamilizi kamwidika, “Ivo kochimanya chiyunani? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ivo, gweye sio ija Mmisili ija vino behi kasonga ubala na kuwashwangiza bumbila da wanhu wehile elufu nne mbaka kuluwala?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo kedika, “Niye ni Myahudi nileligwe Taso muikae ng'hulu ya Kilikia. Nokupula ng'hani ning'he chibali nilonge na wanhu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ija mkulu wa wamilizi kamwing'ha chibali. Baho Paulo kema hachanha muingazi kawahungila waja wanhu mkono, na viwakalile hupi, kasonga kulonga nao kwa Chiebulania.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Ndugu zangu na tati zangu, tegelezeni mbuli ino viili!”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Viwahulike yolonga nao, kwa chiebulania wagendelela kunyamala hupii kubita baho haumwanduso. Nayo Paulo kagendelela kulonga, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Niye ni Myahudi, nileligwa muikae ya Taso ili Kilikia. Mbali nikulila bahano mui kae ya Yelusalemu kama mwaluko wa Gamalieli. Nifundigwa goya kuwinza mahala ga wavele wetu. Niilava kwa moyo wose kwa mbuli ya Mulungu kama vumli mweye wenyego vino sambi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Niwadununza na kuwakoma waja wanhu wose waitogole nzila ino. Niwagela mmakono walume na wanachike na kuwafunga mdigeleza. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mkulu wa walava nhambiko na chitala chose cha wavele wodaha kulongelela mbuli iyo. Nibokela balua kulawa kumwao wawandikile waja ndugu Wayahudi wakalile uko Damasiko. Niita Damasiko ili niwagele mmakono wanhu wao na kuwagala wafungwa mbaka Yelusalemu ili walamuligwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolongelela vija Yesu viyamlawile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Sang’hano za Wasenga 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Ivo, vinikalile mmabehi na Damasiko, yopata saa sita imisi, bung'hulo kulu kulawa kuulanga bahaja dilawila dinibung'hulila ubanzi wose. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Baho nigwa hasi, na nihulika dizi donilongela, ‘Sauli Sauli! Habali konidununza?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Niye niuza, ‘Gweye kwanani Mndewa?’ Nayo kanilongela, ‘Iyo niye Yesu wa Nazaleti ija umdununza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Baho waja wanhu wakalile hamwe na niye, wadiona dija bung'hulo mbali hawadihulike dija dizi da ija yalongile na niye.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Baho niye niuza, ‘Nhende choni Mndewa?’ Nayo Mndewa kanilongela, ‘Ima genda Damasiko na uko kolongeligwa gaja gose Mulungu gayalondile ugatende.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kwa mbuli ya bung'hulo dija dibalike, sidahile kuona na ivo waja wayangu wanilongoza kwa kunyamha mkono mbaka nivika Damasiko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Uko kukala na munhu imwe yokemigwa Anania, munhu yomfugamila Mulungu, yotegeleza ndagizi zetu na yatogoligwa ng'hani na Wayahudi wakalile wokala Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Iyo kakala yezile kunilola ivo kema behi na niye, kalonga, ‘Ndugu Sauli, uone kaidi!’ Bahaja meso gangu gasonga kuona kaidi, na nimuona Anania. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Amala Anania kalonga, ‘Mulungu wa tata zetu kakusagula gweye udahe kumanya goyolonda na kumuona ija mtumigwa wake yotogoligwa na Mulungu na kumhulika iyo mwenyego viyolonga. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwavija kowalongela wanhu wose chija chuuonile na kukihulika kulawa kumwake. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Sambi kobeta choni? Ima ubatizigwe na kusunhigwa na kulekeseligwa malozo gako kwa kuditogola zina jake.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa komtuma Paulo kuwaligulila wanhu haweli Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Baho nibwela Yelusalemu na vinikalile nopula Muing'anda ya Mulungu, bahaja mhata maloleso, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />nimuona Mndewa konilongela, ‘Iyohe usegele Yelusalemu hima manake wanhu wa hano hawalonda kutogola chiulonga kwa mbuli yangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Niye nimwidika, ‘Mndewa, wao wenyego wovimanya kua niye iyo ija nikalile noita Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi na kuwagela mmakono na kuwatoa waja wakalile wokutogola. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Nakua ija shahidi wako Stefano viyakomigwe, niye mwenyego nikala haja na kuona vija viwakalile womkoma, na nikala nokwamila gaja makoti gawakalile womkoma.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Nayo Mndewa kanilongela, ‘Genda kwavija nokulagiza kutali kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Dija bumbila da wanhu wamtegeleza Paulo mbaka viyalongile mbuli iyo na kusonga kuguta nyangi kwa dizi kulu, “Mkomeni, munhu kama iyo halondeka kua mgima!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Chipindi viwakalile woguta nyangi na kwasa vivalo vao kuno wotimula timbwisi kuchanha. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Ija mkulu wa wamilizi kawalongela wanhu wake wamgale Paulo muingome. Kawalongela wamlibule ili wapate kumanya habali Wayahudi womtowela nyangi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Mbali viwakalile womfunga ili wamlibule, Paulo kamuuza mkulu wa chikosi cha wamilizi imwe yemile haja, “Ivo, ndagizi yotogoligwa kumwenu kumlibula mwenekae wa Lumi yang'hali hanalamuligwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ija mkulu wa chikosi cha wamilizi viyahulike gago, kamwing'ha usenga ija mkulu wa wamilizi kalonga, “Kolonda kutenda choni? Munhu ino ni mwenekae wa Lumi!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Baho ija mkulu wa wamilizi kamuwinza Paulo, kamuuza, “Nilongele ivo, gweye ni mwenekae wa Lumi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulo kedika,“Enaa niye mwenekae wa Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mkulu wa wamilizi kalonga, “Na niye ivija nikala mwenekae wa Lumi kwa kuliha sente nyingi.” Paulo nayo kalonga, “Mbali niye iyo mwenekae wa kuleligwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Bahaja wanhu waja wakalile wolonda kumuuza Paulo wasegela hima. Hata ija mkulu wa wamilizi kadumba viyahulike kua Paulo ni mwenekae wa Lumi na kua kakala kamala kumfunga minyololo.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kogaligwa Mchitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Igolo yake, mkulu wa wamilizi kalonda kugamanya gaja gose Wayahudi wakalile womlongeleza Paulo. Ivo, Kamvugula Paulo ija minyololo, kalamula vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na chitala chose waiting'hanile. Amala kamgala Paulo na kumwimiza haulongozi ya chitala.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo kawalola kwa kawabunhulila meso waja wasenga wa chitala amala kalonga, “Mweye ndugu zangu, mbaka vino sambi nikala nomsang'hanila goya Mulungu kwa moyo mzelu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Baho, mkulu wa walava nhambiko Anania kawalagiza waja wamile behi na Paulo wamtoe ng'hua mumlomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Baho, Paulo kamlongela, “Mulungu mwenyego kokutoa gweye uli kama ng'huta ibakigwe chokaa! Kodahaze kukala baho na kunilamula kubitila ndagizi, mbali gweye mwenyego koibena ndagizi kwa kulamula niye nitoigwe?<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Waja wanhu wemile behi na Paulo wamlongela, “Ivo gweye komliga mkulu wa walava nhambiko wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo kedika, “Mweye ndugu zangu, simanyile kama iyo iyo mkulu wa walava nhambiko. Manake Mayandiko yolonga vino, ‘Sekeulonge vihile kwa mkulu wa wanhu wako.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Chipindi icho Paulo kamala kuvimanya kua wamwenga wao wakala Masadukayo na wamwenga ni Mafalisayo. Baho, Paulo kagangamiza dizi haulongozi ha chitala, “Mweye ndugu zangu, niye ni mfalisayo mwana wa mfalisayo. Niye nigaligwa mchitala kwa vija notumanila kua wafile wozilibuka!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, ndwagi ilawilila kati ya Masadukayo na Mafalisayo na mting'hanilo uwo uugola mhande mbili.<verse eid="ACT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Mbuli iwagole ikala ino, Masadukayo wao hawatogola kuzilibuka kwa wafile, hebu kua Watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, hebu Muhe, mbali Mafalisayo hutogola mbuli zose izo nhatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Nyangi zongezeka na wafundaji wamwenga wa ndagizi wa chibumbila cha Mafalisayo wema na kulema kwa kugangamiza walonga, “Cheye hachiona mbuli yoyose ihile kumwake! Yodahika Muhe hebu watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu iyo kalonga nao!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ndwagi ikala ng'hulu mbaka ija mkulu wa wamilizi kadumba kua Paulo yahakanhigwe vihande vihande. Baho, kalagiza wamilizi wake wengile mdibumbila na kumlava Paulo na kumbweleza muingome.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Muichilo chija, Mndewa kema behi na Paulo na kamlongela, “Seke udumbe! Kulonga goya mbuli zangu hano Yelusalemu na kosang'hana ivo muikae ya Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi weka chigwena cha kumkoma Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Vuuchile, Wayahudi weka chigwena cha kifiso. Wailahila na kulonga honda waje wala kung'wa mbaka vonda wamkome iyo Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wanhu wekile chigwena icho wakala wobita wanhu alubaini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Amala waita kwa vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na wavele walonga, “Cheye chiitogolela kwa kuilahila kua hachija chinhu hebu kung'wa mbaka chimkome Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Kwaivo, mweye hamwe na chitala lagizeni usenga kwa mkulu wa wamilizi ili yamgale iyo Paulo kumwenu, kuno momvwizila kua molonda kuzimanya goya mbuli zake vizili. Cheye chokua tiyali kumkoma yang'hali hanavika hano.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mbali mwihwage Paulo kahulika mbuli ya chigwena icho, ivo kaita mgati ya ija ngome na kamlongela Paulo mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Baho, Paulo kamkema mmilizi imwe mwa waja wamilizi kamlongela, “Msole ino mbwanga mgale kwa mkulu wa wamilizi, kanajo ja kumlongela mkulu iyo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ivo, iyo mkulu wa chikosi cha wamilizi kamsola mbwanga ija na kumlongoza mbaka kwa mkulu wa wamilizi na kamlongela, “Ija mfungigwa Paulo kanikema na kunilongela nimgale mbwanga ino kumwako kwa vija kana mbuli ya kukulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Ija mkulu wa wamilizi kamwamha mkono ija mbwanga na kaita nayo hanhu hakifiso, kamuuza, “Haya konda unilongele choni?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ija mbwanga kedika, “Wayahudi waitogolela kua wakupule umgale Paulo mchitala igolo, kama vija wolonda kuzimanya goya mbuli za Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Mbali gweye seke utogole kwa vija hana wanhu wengi wobita alubaini wobete kumvamila. Ivo wailahila hawalonda kuja hebu kung'wa mbaka wamkome Paulo. Vino sambi wakala tiyali, wobeta tu ulamuzi wako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu wa wamilizi kamfunda ija mbwanga na kamleka yaite na kalonga, “Seke umlongele munhu yoyose kama kungalila usenga uno.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kogaligwa Kaisalea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Baho, mkulu wa wamilizi kawakema vilongozi wake waidi na kawalongela, “Watandeni wamilizi mia mbili, na wakwela falasi sabini na wamilizi mia mbili weli na migoha, waite Kaisalea na mkale tiyali kusegela kabula ya saa nhatu lelo ichilo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Watandeni goya falasi wamwenga kwa mbuli ya mwanza wa Paulo kwa Felisi mkulu wa Mkoa.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Amala iyo mkulu wa wamilizi kandika balua vino:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Niye Klaudia Lusia nokwandikila gweye mlongozi Feliksi ili nikulamse. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />“Wayahudi wamgoga munhu ino na walonda kumkoma, mbali vinilongeligwe kua munhu ino mwenekae wa Lumi, niye na wamilizi zangu chiita kumlohola seke yakomigwe na wanhu wao. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nilonda kuvimanya habali wamlongeleza, ivo nimgala mchitala chao. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nivimanya kua mbuli yenyego waigombile ikala ndwagi ya mbuli ya ndagizi yao, ivo sionile chochose chimlonda iyo yakomigwe hebu yafungigwe mdigeleza.<verse eid="ACT 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Vinilongeligwe kua Wayahudi weka chigwena cha kumkoma, nimgala kumwako na niwalongela waja womlongeleza wagale kumwako gaja gose gowomlongeleza.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Baho, wao wamilizi wamsola Paulo kama viwalamuligwe, chilo chija wamgala mbaka uko Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Igolo yake waja wamilizi wogenda kwa magulu wabwela muingome, wawaleka waja wamilizi wakwela falasi wagendelele na mwanza wao hamwe na iyo Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Viwavikile uko Kaisalea wamwing'ha mkulu Feliksi ija balua na kumwika Paulo muuwimilizi wake. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mkulu Feliksi viyakomeleze kusoma iyo balua kawauza, Paulo kolawa kulihi? Viyalongeligwe kua Paulo kolawa Kilikia <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kalonga, “Nokwiza kuitegeleza mbuli yako mala waheza waja wokulongeleza kumwangu.” Baho, kalagiza kua Paulo yekigwe muuwimilizi muing'anda ya ufaume ya Helode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi womlongeleza Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Vigabitile mazua matano, mkulu wa walava nhambiko Anania kavika Kaisalea hamwe na wavele wamwenga, na munhu imwe yokemigwa Tilitulo galu wa ndagizi za Musa. Wamuwinza mkulu Feliksi wamlongelezela mbuli zose ziyatendile Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulo viyakemigwe mng'anda, Telitulo kasonga kulonga, “Go mkulu Felisi! Ulongozi wako unogile uwo uching'ile utindiwala ng'hani mbaka mbuli nyingi zihile muiisi yetu zilavigwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Choibokela mbuli ino kwa ndeng'helo mazua gose mkulu Feliksi na ivija chila hanhu cholava hewela nyingi kumwako. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Mbali, silonda kukutenda ulegele ng'hani, ila chokupula kwa unovu wako uchitegeleze chidogo mbuli yetu.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Chivimanya kua munhu ino cha ndwagi. Iyo koshwangiza ndwagi mwa Wayahudi chila hanhu muiisi na ivija iyo chilongozi wa chija chikosi cha Wanazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ivija kageza kuitenda ng'anda ya Mulungu sekeitogoligwe kwambuli ya nhambiko, mbali cheye chimgela mmakono. Chilonda kumlamula kuilinga na ndagizi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Mbali Lusia, mkulu wa wamilizi, kengilila mbuli iyo, na kamsola kwa ludabwa kulawa mmakono getu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Amala kawakema waja wamlongelezele weze haulongozi hako. Manake kama wahamuuza Paulo gweye mwenyego kodaha kuzimanya mbuli zake zose zino chizilonga kumwako.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Nao waja Wayahudi waitogolela na kulonga kua mbuli zino zose ziwamlongeleze zikala kweli.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela haulongozi ha Feliksi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Baho, mkulu Feliksi kamwing'ha chilaguso Paulo yalonge mbuli, nayo Paulo kalonga, “Nodeng'helela kuigombela mbuli haulongozi hako, kuno novimanya kua kukala mlamuzi wa isi ino kwa milao mingi. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Mwenyego, kodaha kuvimanya kua haganabita hata mazua kumi na maidi kulawa viniitile kufugama uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayahudi hawanivikile nolonga na munhu yoyose. Hawanivikile noshwangiza wanhu mui ng'anda ya Mulungu hebu Mzing'anda zao za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, hebu hanhu hengine hohose muikae iyo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Ivija wabule mbuli ya ukweli ya kunilongeleza kumwako. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Chinitogola kumwako iyo chino, “Niye nomfugamila Mulungu wa wavele zetu kuno nokala kwa kuilinga na nzila ija wao woikema nzila ya ufundaji wa uvwizi. Nozitogola mbuli zose zandikigwe mvitabu va ndagizi na walagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Niye ninajo tumanilo kama wao viwali na tumanilo, kua wanhu wotogoligwa na Mulungu na wehile wose wokwiza kuzilibuka. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Kwaivo, nogangamala mazua gose niwe na moyo mzelu haulongozi ha Mulungu na ha wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Baho, vinikalile kutali kwa milao mingi, nibwela Yelusalemu ili kuwataza wenekae wayangu welibule chinhu na kulava nhosa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Chipindi vinikalile nosang'hana gago, ivo wanivikile mui ng'anda ya Mulungu, vinikomeleze kuitenda nitogoligwe kwambuli ya nhambiko. Hahawile na bumbila da wanhu hebu siwaswangize wanhu kutenda ndwagi yoyose. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Mbali hakala na Wayahudi wamwenga kulawa uko Asia, wao iyo walondeka kukala haulongozi hako na kulonga kama hana mbuli yoyose ihile initendile, <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />hebu walongele wanhu wemile hano walonge mbuli gani ihile waionile haja hanimile haulongozi hachitala chikulu, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila kwambuli zino zinilongile vinimile haja haulongozi hao, ‘Monilamula lelo kwa vija notogola kua wafile wozilibuligwa.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Baho, mkulu Feliksi ija yakalile yovimanya goya mbuli ya nzila ija, hagendelele kutegeleza ijo mbali kalonga, “Nolava ulamuzi wa mbuli ino mala tu yaheza Lusia, ija mkulu wa wamilizi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Bahaja kamlongela ija mkulu wa chikosi cha wamilizi yamwike Paulo muuwimilizi, mbali yawe na nyafasi chidodo na mbwiga zake seke wagomigwe kumwing'ha vinhu viyolonda.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feliksi na Dulusila wotegeleza gayalongelezigwe Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Vigabite mazua madodo, Feliksi na mwehe wake yokemigwa Dulusila ija yakalile Myahudi. Kalagiza Paulo yagaligwe hamwake, nayo kamtegeleza viyakalile yolonga kwa mbuli ya kumtogola Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Mbali chipindi Paulo viyasongile kulongelela mbuli ya kusang'hana gaja gatogoligwa na Mulungu, na mbuli ya kuikimila na kwa mbuli ya zua da ulamuzi vidikwiza, Feliksi kadumba na kalonga, “Sambi nyamala kodaha kuita, nokwiza kukukema kaidi haja nahapata nyafasi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Chipindi ichoicho Feliksi kakala yotumanila kua Paulo yahamwing'ile chinhu chochose ili yamlekese. Kwa mbuli iyo kamkema Paulo chila mala na kulonga nayo.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Kwa vija Filiksi kakala yonda kuweng'ha deng'o Wayahudi, kamleka Paulo mdigeleza. Viibitile milao midi, Polikio Festo kaisola nyafasi ya Feliksi kakala mkulu wa Mkoa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kopula mbuli yake igaligwe kwa mfaume mkulu wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Zua da kadatu kulawa viyavikile yolongoza mumkoa wa Kaisalia, Festo kakwela kuita Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />kuja wakala vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamlongela mbuli ikalile yomgoga Paulo. Wampula ng'hani Festo <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />yaweng'he deng'o waiyeka kwambuli ya kumgala Paulo Yelusalemu, kuno wakala weka chigwena cha kumkoma Paulo yahawa mnzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festo kawedika,”Paulo kamu wimilizi Kaisalea na niye noita uko vino behi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Walekeni vilongozi wenu waite uko hamwe na niye wakalonge mbuli zao za kumlongeleza munhu iyo kama kasang'hana mbuli ihile yoyose.” <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo kakala nao kwamazua nane hebu kumi vino, amala kabwela Kaisalea. Igolo yake kaita mchitala na kukala mchigoda cha ulamuzi na kalagiza Paulo yagaligwe hamwake. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulo viyavikile, Wayahudi waja wakalile walawa Yelusalemu wamzunguluka na kusonga kumlongeleza mbuli ndala nyingi zija hawadahile hata kuzilagusa ukweli wake.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Mbali Paulo kaigombela mwenyego kalonga, “Niye sibanange mbuli yoyose ya kubela ndagizi za Wayahudi, hebu kwa mbuli ya kubela ng'anda ya Mulungu hebu kwa mbuli ya kumbela Kaisali,”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Mbali Festo kalonda kuweng'ha ndeng'helo Wayahudi kwaivo kamuuza Paulo, “Ivo, Koona vinoga kuita Yelusalemu na uko ukalamuligwe haulongozi hangu kwa mbuli zino?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo kedika, “Nie nima hachitala cha Kaisalia, baho baho nolondeka kulamuligwa. Kama vuumanyile goya niye siwatendile Wayahudi chochose chihile. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Baho yahawa hana chinhu chochose chihile chinitendile chinitenda nilamuligwe ifa, silema kulamuligwa. Mbali yahawa gaja gawanilongeleza wanhu wano sio kweli habule yoyose yonda yanilave kumwao Yelusalemu. Nokupula nigaleni kwa Kaisali mkulu wa Lumi.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Amala Festo viyakomeleze kulongelela na wanhu wake wa chitala kamlongela Paulo, “Kulonda kuita kwa mfaume mkulu wa Lumi, enaa koita kwa mfaume wa Lumi.<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festo kumlongela Agilipa gawamlongeleza Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Vigabitile mazua madodo, mfaume Agilipa na Benike lumbu jake wakwela kuita Kaisalea kumbokela Festo kua kilongozi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Wakala uko kwa mazua mengi na walongelela na mfaume kwa kwambuli ya gaja gawamlongeleze Paulo, Festo kalonga, “Hano hana munhu ija Feliksi kamleka mdigeleza, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />vinivikile uko Yelusalemu, wakulu walava nhambiko na vilongozi wa Wayahudi waniwinza na kunipula nie nimlamule kua kana mbuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mbali niye niwedikila kua sio mazoela ga Walumi kumlava munhu yalamuligwe kama iyo yang'hali hawana ivika na waja womlongeleza ili yeng'higwe nyafasi ya kuigombela kwa gaja gawamlongeleza. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ivo, viwavikile hano hamwe na nie sikawile, igolo yake nikema chitala nilamula munhu iyo yagaligwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Waja wamlongeleze viwemile hawalongile jojose dihile kwambuli yake kama vinitumanile. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ila wakala woibishila na Paulo kwambuli ya kufugama kwao na kwambuli ya munhu imwe yadanganike yokemigwa Yesu ija Paulo kagendelela kulonga kua munhu iyo ni mgima. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kwavija simanyile cha kutenda kwambuli iyo. Baho nimuuza Paulo kama koona vinoga kuita Yelusalemu kuwedika kwa gaja gawamlongeleza. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Mbali Paulo kalonda yalamuligwe na mfaume wa Lumi, ivo nilagiza yakale hano mbaka vonda nimgale kwa mfaume mkulu wa Lumi.<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa kamlongela Festo, “Nolonda nimhulike nie mwenyego munhu ino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">“Festo kedika, “Komhulika igolo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Igolo yake Aglipa na Benike lumbu jake wavika na kubokeligwa kwa ndeng'helelo ng'hulu, wengila muluhelengo wa chitala kuno woilongoza na wakulu wa isi na vilongozi wa kae.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:23">Baho, Festo kalagiza Paulo yagaligwe mchitala.<verse eid="ACT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Amala Festo kalonga, “Mfaume Agilipa na wanhu wose mli hano hamwe na cheye. Mmuona munhu ino, Wayahudi wose weli hano na wa kuja Yelusalemu womnung'hunikila na kuguta nyangi wolonga kua munhu ino kasang'hana mbuli zihile na halondeka kua mgima. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mbali niye sionile kama kakala yabanange chochose chihile mbaka yalondeke kulamuligwa ifa. Mbali kwa vija iyo mwenyego kamlonda mfaume mkulu yategeleze ulamuzi wake, ivo nilagiza kumgala Lumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mbali kwa ubanzi wangu nabule da kumwandikila Muhenga Kaisali mfaume mkulu wa Lumi kwa mbuli ya munhu iyo. Iyo mana nimgala munhu hamwenu na hamwako mfaume Aglipa, ili wahamala kulonga nayo, mhate chinhu cha kwandika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwavija noona kua uzeha kumgala mfungigwa bila kulagusa ubananzi wake.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela haulongozi wa mfaume Aglipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Baho Aglipa kamlongela Paulo, “Sambi kodaha kuigombela.” Baho Paulo kenula mkono wake kulagusa kuwa kosonga kuigombela kalonga,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Go mfaume Aglipa, niye noina ning'higwa ng'hekewa lelo kigombela haulongozi yako kwambuli zose zinilongelezigwe na Wayahudi,<verse eid="ACT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />kwa vija gweye mwenyego kumanya goya mazoela ga Wayahudi na ndwagi zao, ivo nokupula unhegeleze kwa kufunya moyo.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayahudi wose wonimanya goya kulawa vinikalile ching'hele, kulawa vinikalile muiisi yangu mbaka vinikalile Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wao wonimanya niye kwa chipindi chitali na wodaha kuzilonga mbuli kama wahalonda, kua kulawa mwaka nikala munhu imwe mwa chibumbila chija cha Mafalisayo wotegeleza ndagizi za dini ya Kuyahudi kubita chibumbila chimwenga chochose.<verse eid="ACT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Vino sambi nolongelezigwa hano kwa vija tu notumanila laliko dija Mulungu diyawalike tati zetu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Laliko ijo iyo dija ditumainiligwa na makabila kumi na maidi ga wanhu wa isi yetu, kuno womsang'hanila Mulungu vija viilondeka misi na chilo. Go mkulu mfaume, Wayahudi wonilamula kwambuli ya tumanilo dino! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Mweye habali mmwenu moona udala ng'hani kutogola kua Mulungu kowazilibula wafile?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Kweli niye mwenyego baho mwaka niona kua nilondeka kusang'hana gose gadahika ili kulema zina da Yesu wa Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mbuli izo izo nizisang'hane uko Yelusalemu. Niye ning'higwa ukulu kulawa kwa wakulu wa walava nhambiko, niwagela wanhu wengi wa Mulungu mdigeleza na viwalamuligwe kukomigwa, nitogola wakomigwe.<verse eid="ACT 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Nikala noita Mzing'anda zao za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kuno nowatenda watoigwe na kuwaswangiza waleke kumtogola Yesu. Ludoko lwangu kumwao lukala lukulu mbaka niita mzikae za nyambenyambe ili niwadununze.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolonga vija viyaloholigwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Sang’hano za Wasenga 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Zua dimwe vinikalile mmiyanza iyo, vinikalile noita Damasiko, kuno nikala na ukulu na malagizo kulawa kwa wakulu wa walava nhambiko.<verse eid="ACT 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Go mfaume, vinikalile mnzila saa sita imisi, niona bung'hulo dibalika kubita zua, dibung'hula kulawa kuulanga, dinizunguluka niye hamwe na waja weli muumwanza umwe na niye. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Cheye chose chigwa hasi, nihulika dizi dolonga kwa chiebulania, ‘Sauli, Sauli habali konidununza? Gweye koilumiza bule kuihuma na nie kama vija mhunda viyoitoa teke mbalati ya msusilaji wake.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Niye niuza, ‘Gweye kwa nani Mndewa?’ Nayo Mndewa kedika, ‘Niye iyo Yesu ija yumdununza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Mbali lamuka na wime kwa magulu gako. Nikulawila gweye ili nikutende uwe mtumigwa wangu. Kowalongela wanhu gaja ugaonile lelo na gaja gonda nikulagusile. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nokulohola kulawa kwa Wayahudi wayago na wanhu haweli Wayahudi waja nonda nikulagize kumwao.<verse eid="ACT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Kokwiza kuwataza wanimanye walawe mdiziza na kwingila mdibung'hulo, walawe muukulu wa Mwenembago, wambwelele Mulungu ili walekesiligwe malozo gao wakale hamwe na waja wonitogola.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolongelela mbuli ya utumigwa wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Ivo, mfaume Agilipa, silekile kugategeleza gaja maloleso galawile kuulanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ila mosi nisonga kuligula kwa wanhu wa Damesiko, amala kwa waja wa Yelusalemu na isi yose ya Uyahudi, ivija kwa wanhu wa isi zimwenga. Niwaligulila kua wamlongele Mulungu malozo gao na kugaleka amala wambwelele Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwa mbuli iyo, Wayahudi wanigoga vinikalile Muing'anda ya Mulungu, na wageza kunikoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Mbali Mulungu kanitaza, ivo mbaka vino lelo nima na nolongelela kweli kwa wanhu wose, wakulu na wadodo. Silonga chochose kubita gaja galongigwe na Musa na walagusi wa Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />ivo ilondeka Kilisito yadununzigwe na kua wa mosi kuzilibuka, ili yawabunhulile bung'hulo da ulohozi kwa wanhu wose, kwa Wayahudi wayage na wanhu haweli Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Baho, Paulo viyakalile yoigombela, Festo kalonga kwa dizi kulu,”Paulo! Ivo gweye kuna nzewele kweli! Kusoma kwako ng'hani kokugela chichala!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Mbali Paulo kedika, “Go mkulu Festo niye nabule chichala. chinilonga ni kweli muhala. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Hata gomkulu mfaume kozimanya mbuli zose zino, ivo nodaha kuzilonga bila kudumba hamwake. Kwa vija novimanya kua habule hata chinhu chimwe huchimanyile, kwa vija mbuli ino haitendeke mchifiso. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mfaume Agilipa, ivo, kogatogola gaja gowolonga walagusi wa Mulungu? Novimanya kua kogatogoga!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa kamwidika Paulo, “Ivo koniswangiza hima hima ivo niwe Mkilisito kwa chipindi chiguhi?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo kedika, “Nompula Mulungu kua kwa chipindi chiguhi hebu chitali, ivo sio gweye uiyeka, mbali wose wonihulika niye wapate kukala kama vinili niye, ila tu bila minyololo ino.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Baho, mfaume Agilipa na mkulu Festo na Belinike na waja wose wakalile hamwe nao wema, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />viwalawile, wailongela, ‘Munhu ino hatendile chochose chimlonda yafe hebu yafungigwe.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Nayo Agilipa kamlongela Festo, “Munhu ino yahafunguligwe, kama halondile kuita kwa Kaisali mfaume mkulu wa Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kamuumwanza kuita Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Viwamalile kuitogolela kua chiite mwanza wa Italia kubitila bahalini, wamwika Paulo hamwe na wafungigwa wamwenga muwimilizi wa Juliasi yakalile chilongozi wa wamilizi mchibumbila chikemigwa “Chibumbila cha jeshi la Kaisali mfaume mkulu wa Lumi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Chikwela meli ilawa uko Adilamito ikalile yoita mwanza kubitila kae zili mgwazo mgwazo wa bahali mwa isi ya Asia na Alisitaliko mwene kae ya Makedonia kulawa Sesalonike, kakala na cheye.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Imitondo yake, chivika bandali ya Sidoni. Juliasi kamtendela goya Paulo kwa kumleka yaite kuwaona mbwiga zake na kumwing'ha chija chiyalonda. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Vichilawile uko chigendelela na mwanza muibahali, mbali kwa vija beho dikala dobuma ng'hani, chibitila ubanzi wa chisiwa cha Kipulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Vichilokile bahali ikalile ubanzi wa Kilikia na Pamfulia na chima haikae ya Mila uli mumkoa wa Likia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Baho ija chilongozi wa wamilizi kaivika meli imwe ya Alekizandilia ikalile yoita Italia, na baho kachikweza umo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kwavija beho dikala dogendelela kuchikimila, mazua mengi chiita mwanza uwo mholemhole, na kugazika ng'hani mbaka chivika behi na kae ya Nido. Chigendelela na mwanza kwakubitila ubanzi wa chisiwa cha Kilete chikalile mwambu na mwambu na Salumone.<verse eid="ACT 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Chibita hamgwazomgwazo mwa mhwani kwa udala mbaka chivika hanhu hokemigwa Bandali Inogile, behi na kae ya Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ivo, chipindi chitali chikala chibitile chili muumwanza, na mbaka msimo wa kufunga kuja ukala ubita. Baho ikala mbuli ndala ng'hani kuita mwanza kwa meli. Ivo Paulo kawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Mwee wakulu, niye notonga kua uno mwanza wokua na bung'hukila na chokwagiza mbahasha na meli na ugima wetu ivija.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Mbali ija chilongozi wa chikosi wamilizi kategeleza goya gaja gayalongile ija mlongoza meli na ija yeli na ngalawa kubita gaja gayalongile Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwaivo, kwa vija ija bandali haikalile hanhu hanogile hakukala chipindi cha mbeho, wanhu wengi walonga kua chigendele na mwanza ihadahika mbaka kuja Foinike, na kukala uko chipindi cha mbeho. Foinike ni bandali ya Kilete, ija ilola hagati ya ubanzi wa hasi na ubanzi wa uswelo wa zua.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ondo ng'hulu mwibahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Baho, mbeho ya utindiwala ya ubanzi wa hasi isonga kubuma mholembole, nao wagesa kua wahuma mbuli yao, ivo wasegeza zuma dakugogela Meli wasonga mwanza na meli mugwazo mwa chisiwa cha Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Mbali vichibitile chipindi chiguhi, beho kulu dikemigwa, “Beho da ubanzi wa kuchanha na muusimbukilo wa zua.” usonga kubuma kulawa mchisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Beho diitoa ija meli, na haidahile kuukimila, ivo chipotigwa kuigala meli kuja kudilawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Vichikalile chobita mchisiwa chidodo chokemigwa Kauda chidaha kwika goya ngalawa ya meli ya kuloholela wanhu hata kama kwa udala. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Wanhu viwakomeleze kuikwega ngalawa iyo mgati mwa meli, amala waizingiliza nzabi hasi ya iyo meli ili kuzika hamwe. Wadumba kugaligwa mumsanga kuimhwani ya Libia. Kwaivo, waihulumusa nhanga na kuileka meli isunhigwe na beho. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Beho kulu digendelela kubuma ng'hani na igolo yake chisonga kwasa kunze zija mbahasha kulawa mui meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Zua da kadatu, wasonga kwasa mmazi vinhu va meli kwa makono gao wemwego.<verse eid="ACT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa chipindi cha mazua mengi hachionile zua hebu nhondo, na beho kulu digendelela kubumha ng'hani, mbaka matamanilo gose ga kuloholigwa gamala.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ivo, viwakalile mazua mengi bila kuja ndia, Paulo kema hagati yao kalonga, “Mwe wanhu, yahawile goya kama mwahanitegeleze na kuleka kuita mwanza wenu kulawa Kilete. Kama mwahatendile ivo, chihainegile na bung'hukila ino ya kuibanaga meli na kwasa vinhu vino vose.<verse eid="ACT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Mbali sambi nowapulani mfunye moyo! Habule hata munhu imwe mmwenu yondayawagize ugima wake, meli iiyeka iyo yonda ibanangike. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kwavija jana ichilo Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, Mulungu ija niye ni wake iyo nomfugamila kanilawila, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />na kalonga, ‘Paulo sekeudumbe! Kwavija kolondeka wime haulongozi ha Kaisali mfaume mkulu wa Lumi, kwambuli yako Mulungu kolohola ugima wa chila munhu ulinayo muumwanza.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Kwaivo, mweye wakulu funyeni moyo! Kwavija notumanila yokua kama viyanilongele. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Mbali chogaligwa mbaka mchisiwa chimwenga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ichilo mwa zua da kumi na nne, chikala chohembelusigwa kuno na kuja muibahali ya Adilia. Muichilo chikulu, waja watoa mbizi wagesa kua behi na mhwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Baho wazambwila utali wa china cha bahali kwa kuihumulusa nzabi ikalile ifungigwe chinhu chizamile, watambula utali wa china cha mazi cha mita alubaini. Hamwande wapima nzabi ija kaidi, wapata mita isilini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwa mbuli ya kudumba kubwenga mibwe mikulu, wazihulumusa nanga nne haichisogo ha meli na wapula hima ivike imitondo.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Waja watoambizi walonda kuibanga kulwa muimeli, ivo waihulumusa ija ngalawa ndodo mmazi, kama wolagusa kua woita kuhulumusa nanga za ubanzi wa ulongozi wa meli.<verse eid="ACT 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Mbali Paulo kamlongela ija chilongozi wa wamilizi na wamilizi wake, “Kama wanhu wano watoambizi hawasigala muimeli mweye hamdaha kuhonyigwa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Bahaja waja wamilizi wazikanha zija nzabi zikalile zigogile ija ngalawa na waileka usoligwe na mazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Viivikile lukwili, Paulo kawapula wanhu wose waje ndia kalonga, “Mmazua kumi na mane mkala mogwaya na kukala bila kuja chinhu chochose. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Ivo, nompulani diyeni ndia kwa vija molondeka kukala na ugima. Manake hata mvili imwe mmatwi genu ilonda kwaga.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, Paulo kasola gate, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu haulongozi mwao wose, kaubena na kusonga kuja. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Baho, wose wapata tamanilo, nao ivija waja ndia. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Muimeli wanhu wose chikala mia mbili na sabini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ivo, chila munhu imwe viyakomeleze kuja ndia na kwiguta goya, wahunguza uzamo wa meli kwa kwasa zija mbahasha za ngano.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Beho kulu dobena meli yobeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Vuuchile, wote hawadahile kuimanya isi ija, ila waona msanga mhwani, walonda kuita kwima uko kama ihadahika. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kwaivo wazikanha nanga zose na kuzileka muibahali. Wazihumbulula nzabi zija zikalile zifunga usukani, amala wafungula tanga dili haulongozi ili digoge beho na kuchigala mhwani.<verse eid="ACT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Mbali wavika hanhu heli na mikondo midi haiiting'hanila na meli yenzeka haja haulongozi ha meli hadidimila mumsanga na haidahile kukwesa ivo ubanzi wa chisogo wa meli usonga kubeneka kwambuli ya bung'hukila ya mazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Waja wamilizi walonda kuwakoma wafungigwa wose kwa kudumba kua waja wafungigwa wahaogelele mbaka mhwani na kuibanga. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Mbali kwavija ija chilongozi wa wamilizi kalonda kumlohola Paulo, baho kawagoma sekewatende ivo. Kawalongela waja wamanyile kogelela wazumhe kulawa muingalawa na kogelela mbaka mhwani, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na wamwenga wawawinze kuno waigogile vihande va mbao hebu vihande va meli ija ibeneke. Ivo, ivo vichivikile goya mhwani.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ziyasang'hane Paulo mchisiwa cha Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Vichivikile goya mhwani, chivimanya kua chija chisiwa chokemigwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wenekae wa baho wakala na wende ng'hani kumwetu. Mvula ikala isonga kutoa na kukala na mbeho, na wao wakoka moto na kuchilongela chikotele. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo kadondola mzigo mdodo wa ngodi na kakala kokwika mmoto, kwambuli ya moto mkali nyoka yeli na sumu ng'hali kalawa mzingodi na kuizinga mumkono wa Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wenekae wa haja viwaonile ija nyoka koning'inila muumkono wa Paulo wailongela, “Yodahika munhu ino kamala kukoma munhu, na ingawa kahonyeka kudanganika muibahali.” Nyinukila ya milungu haimleka yawe mgima. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Mbali Paulo kamkung'hunila ija nyoka muumoto na Paulo halumizigwe hata chidodo. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Waja wanhu wakala wotumanila kua Paulo yahavimbile hebu kugwa hasi na kudanganika bahaja. Mbali viwabetele kwa chipindi chitali na kuona habule chihile chochose chimpatile Paulo, wasonga kutonga vimwenga kwa mbuli ya Paulo na walonga iyo ni mulungu!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Behi na hanhu haja hakala na migunda ya Pubilio, mkulu wa chija chisiwa. Pubilio kachibokela na kuchihunganikila kwa wende mkulu kwa mazua madatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Baho, ikala tati yake Pubilio kawasa mdikomwa, kuno yolumwa homa na kuhala. Paulo kaita kugati mwa tata ija na kumpula Mulungu, na kamwikila makono gake ija mtamu nayo kahona. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Mbuli izo vizilawilile ivo, watamu wose muichisiwa chija weza na wahonyigwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Nao wanhu waching'ha nhogolwa ng'hulu na vichilondile kusonga mwanza, kubitila muibahali wachigweka vinhu vose vichikalile chovilonda.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kovika Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Viibitile miezi midatu, chisonga mwanza wetu kaidi kwa meli imwe ilawa Alekisandilia ikemigwa, “Milungu mhacha,” Manake Kasta na Poluksi. Meli iyo ikala imile mchisiwa mchipindi chose cha mbeho. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Chivika muikae ya Silakusa, na chikala baho kwa mazua madatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kulawila baho, chisegela na chizunguluka mbaka chivika Legio. vidibitile zua dimwe, mbeho isonga kubuma kulawa banzi wa hasi, ivo igolo yake chivika bandali ya Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Uko chiwavika ndugu wamwenga wamtogole Kilisito wachipulia chikale nao kwa juma dimwe. Vino ivo vichivikile muiisi ya Lumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ndugu wa uko Lumi viwahulike mbuli zetu, weza kuchibokela mdigulilo da Apio na uko Migahawa midatu. Paulo viwaonile ivo kamwing'ha Mulungu hewela na kugeligwa moyo.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Vichivikile Lumi, Paulo kaluhusigwa kukala iiyeka hamwe na mmilizi imwe wa kumkimila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Vigabitile mazua madatu, Paulo kawakema vilongozi wa Chiyahudi wa hanhu baho. Viwamalile kuikunzanya hamwe, Paulo kawalongela, “Ndugu zangu, niye mbali sitendile chochose chihile wala kulema mazoela ga wavele wetu, nigeligwa mmakono kuja Yelusalemu na kwikigwa mmakono ga Walumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Viwaniuzile na kuona kua siwile na mbuli yoyose inilondile nife, walonda kunilekesa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Mbali Wayahudi wamwenga walema mbuli iyo, niye nilonda mbuli yangu igaligwe kwa Kaisali mfalume mkulu wa Lumi, ingawa sikalile na chochose cha kuwalongeleza wenekae wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Kwambuli iyo nipula kuonana na kulongelela na mweye, manake nifungigwa minyololo ino kwambuli ya tamanilo dija da Izilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Wao wamwidika, “Cheye hachina bokela balua yoyose kulawa Uyahudi, hebu habule ndugu yoyose yavikile hano na kugala mbuli yoyose hebu kulonga chochose chihile hamwako. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Mbali cholonda chikuhulike mwenyego vondauchilongele, kwa vija chivimanya chila hanhu wanhu wodibela bumbila da wamtogole Kilisito.<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Baho, waigoneka zua da kuiting'hanila, na wanhu wengi wavika uko kuyakalile kokala. Kulawa imitondo mbaka ichigulogulo Paulo kakala kosimulila na kuwafambulila mbuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu kuno kugeza kuwatenda watogole mbuli ya Yesu kwa kutumila ndagizi za Musa na Mayandiko ga walagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wamwenga wao watogola usenga wake mbali wamwenga hawatogole.<verse eid="ACT 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Baho, waihasanya na chila imwe katonga viyamanyile. Viwakalile woita, Paulo kawalongela mbuli ino: “Muhe wa Mulungu kalonga kweli na tati zenu kwa kubitila Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Viyalongile, ‘Genda kwa wanhu wano ukawalongele, “Mokua mohulika mbali hamvimanya, mokua molola mbali hamtambula, <verse eid="ACT 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />kwa vija mioyo ya wanhu wano midala, wagaziba magutwi gao na meso gao wafing'iliza. Kama wahaonile kwa meso gao na wahahulike kwa magutwi gao, na kuvimanya kwa mioyo yao na wahainduke mmoyo na niye nihawaonyile.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Baho Paulo kalonga, “Mvimanye kua usenga wa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya ulohozi ugaligwa kwa wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Wao wotegeleza!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paulo viyakomeleze kulonga gago, Wayahudi wasegela kuno wakala woiuza wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa milao midi yose Paulo kakala muing'anda yapangile mwenyego, kakala kowabokela wose wakalile wokwiza kumwake kumlamusa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Baho kakala yoligula kwa kugagamiza mbuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu na kufunda kwambuli ya Mndewa Yesu Kilisito bila kudumba na bila kukimiligwa na chochose.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>